Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.72,0:00:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们曾经是一个和平的超机械种族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were once a peaceful race of intelligent, mechanical beings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.02,0:00:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但后来却爆发了战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then came the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.86,0:00:56.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一方是为自由而战的汽车人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}between the Autobots, who fought for freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.27,0:01:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另一方则是妄图称霸的霸天虎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the Decepticons, who dreamt of tyranny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.68,0:01:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,敌强我弱 敌众我寡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Overmatched and outnumbered,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.37,0:01:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必败无疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our defeat was all but certain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.72,0:01:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但就在战争临近尾声之时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in the war's final days,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.41,0:01:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一艘汽车人飞船冲出了纷飞的战火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one Autobot ship escaped the battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,飞船上载着一批秘密货物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was carrying a secret cargo,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.97,0:01:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它本可以改变我们母星的命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which would have changed our planet's fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.68,0:01:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是最后的拼死一搏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A desperate mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.17,0:01:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,承载着我们最后的希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our final hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.98,0:02:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而这希望...也破灭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hope that vanished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.62,0:02:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(1961年 新墨西哥州 VLA射电天文台)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个在那里 一个在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One over there. One up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.06,0:02:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一个在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one more down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.38,0:02:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么收获?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.03,0:02:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,探测到撞击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impact detected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确认发生撞击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have impact confirmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.61,0:02:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确认撞击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.68,0:02:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于格林威治时间20点50分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at 2250 GMT.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.43,0:02:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上给我接通国防部长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me SecDef on the phone right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(紧急：跟踪到深空轨迹 探测到月面撞击)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.52,0:02:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(五角大楼 国家安全指挥部)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.17,0:03:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克·纳马拉部长 总统先生在等您{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. McNamara, the President is expecting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.02,0:03:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 让鲍比进来 - 是的 总统先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get Bobby in here. - Mr. President,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最高机密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}designation, top secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.37,0:03:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一艘不明飞行物在在月球上坠落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We believe a UFO has crashed into the Moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.69,0:03:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏联人应该也在调查此事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We think the Russians are onto it as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.31,0:03:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,命令航天局 要动用一切力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then you tell NASA to move heaven and earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得登上月球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get to the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.42,0:03:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得实现一次载人探月行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to attempt a manned mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.05,0:03:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,航天局认为这得花上5年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}NASA said it would take five years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.74,0:03:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,必须抢在苏联人之前登月{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get there before the Russians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.99,0:03:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信我国人民能够齐聚一心全力以赴 达成这个目标...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe that this nation should commit itself to achieving the goal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.37,0:03:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 15秒 - ...即在1970年以前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fifteen seconds. - ...before this decade is out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.97,0:03:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人类将乘坐宇宙飞船登陆月球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of landing a man on the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并且安全返回地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and returning him safely to the Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.15,0:03:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,启动发射程序{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ignition sequence start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,5...4...3...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five, four, three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,2...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.15,0:03:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.91,0:03:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全部引擎工作正常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All engines running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.81,0:03:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发射 已经发射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liftoff. We have a liftoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.05,0:03:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时间是9点32分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty-two minutes past the hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿波罗11号发射升空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liftoff on Apollo 11.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.20,0:04:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿姆斯特朗报告 阿波罗11号飞行轨道正确{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neil Armstrong reporting Apollo 11 on proper heading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿波罗11号开始了旅程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo 11 is on the way, riding that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.73,0:04:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乘着土星5号运载火箭喷射出的长长烈焰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pillar of flame from the Saturn V out there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.73,0:04:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奔向了25万英里之外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}250, 000 miles away,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.29,0:04:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,月球正在那里静候着人类的首次造访{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where the moon is waiting for man 's first arrival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.04,0:04:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是休斯顿 现在准备降落 完毕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Houston, you're a go for landing. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.17,0:04:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,40英尺 下降2.5英尺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forty feet, down two and a half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.93,0:04:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从表面上看都是灰尘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Picking up some dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.91,0:04:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,30英尺 下降2.5英尺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty feet, two and a half down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.91,0:04:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经能看到咱们登月舱的影子了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faint shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 请指示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Capcom, flight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:32.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,向前4英尺 向右漂移一点点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four forward. Drifting to the right a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.58,0:04:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下降0.5英尺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down a half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,轻轻降落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Contact light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.26,0:04:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 关闭引擎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, engine stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.12,0:04:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,休斯顿 到达静海基地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Houston, tranquility base here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.96,0:04:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小鹰号登月舱已经着陆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Eagle has landed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.67,0:04:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到着陆讯号 小鹰号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We copy you down, Eagle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们把大家的脸都快憋青了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a bunch of guys about to turn blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.32,0:04:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总算能松口气了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're breathing again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.99,0:04:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大约有4亿人正在观看今日的直播{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps 400 million persons are watching this broadcast today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.89,0:05:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见证这一时代最伟大的成就{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the greatest event in our time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.82,0:05:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这也是铭载史册的一大壮举{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and one of the great events of all recorded history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我下到了梯子的底部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm at the foot of the ladder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.11,0:05:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在走下了登月舱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'm gonna step off the LEM now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我个人的一小步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's one small step for man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但却是人类的一大步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one giant leap for mankind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 准备好了没? - 好了 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are we good? - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.53,0:05:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,转到1092非正式频道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unofficial time on the first step, 1092....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿波罗11号 这里是休斯顿 完毕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo 11? This is Houston, over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小鹰号 我们遇到了讯号干扰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eagle, we're gettinga signal interference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们听到了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚得到证实 与阿波罗11号的联系暂时出现中断{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We now have had confirmation of loss of signal from the Apollo 11.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿波罗11号此刻正在月球的背面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Apollo 11 is, at the moment, on the far side of the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.45,0:05:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尼尔 你正在月球的背面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neil, you are dark on the rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:05:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始执行任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mission is a go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.02,0:06:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有21分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have 21 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.68,0:06:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请原地待命 倒计时3分45秒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please stand by, 3 minutes and 45 seconds and counting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.49,0:06:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像是张巨大的金属面孔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's some sort of giant metal face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.70,0:06:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,控制中心 我们已进入飞船内部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Control, we are inside the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.09,0:07:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,船体受损严重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Extensive damage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.19,0:07:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难以对飞船进行全面检查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Way too big to check the entire ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.23,0:07:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里一片死寂 休斯顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's dead in here, Houston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有任何生命迹象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No signs of life anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些东西巨大无比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These things are massive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.22,0:07:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.45,0:07:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的氧气还能维持7分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got seven minutes on your oxygen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.73,0:07:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宇宙中并不只有我们 对吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not alone after all, are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.23,0:07:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.89,0:07:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们并不是唯一的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.28,0:07:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请讲 总统先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, Mr. President.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.17,0:07:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好 尼尔和巴兹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Neil and Buzz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我正在白宫椭圆形办公室里给你们打电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talking to you by telephone from the Oval Room at the White House.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.63,0:07:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这绝对是一段将要载入史册的通话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this certainly has to be the most historic telephone call ever made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的自豪之情 我难以言表{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just can't tell you how proud we all are of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.77,0:07:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对每一位美国人来说 这都是此生中最为骄傲的一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For every American, this has to be the proudest day of our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.01,0:07:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你们的伟大壮举...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because of what you have done....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.09,0:07:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已降落在海面上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have splashdown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...太空成为了人类世界的一部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}.... the heavens have become a part of man 's world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.14,0:08:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这宝贵的一刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For one priceless moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.64,0:08:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将会永远铭载人类史册{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the whole history of man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.21,0:08:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全世界的人们此刻心连心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all the people on this Earth are truly one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为你们的壮举而感到骄傲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One in their pride in what you have done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.22,0:08:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这鼓舞着我们要加倍努力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It inspires us to redouble our efforts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.56,0:08:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维护地球的和平与安宁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to bring peace and tranquility to Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.98,0:08:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《变形金刚3：月黑之时》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:05.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的英雄 该醒醒啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My hero needs to wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你的新幸运兔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your new lucky bunny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.05,0:09:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个美好的愿望 卡莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a beautiful thought, Carly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.51,0:09:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过并不是兔子全身都带着好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I don't think it's the whole bunny that's lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.59,0:09:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这只有这一块地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, it's just this section here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有兔脚这里才会带来好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, it's just the rabbit foot that's lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.63,0:09:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 这只是个开运魔法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's just a good luck charm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.40,0:09:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能让你积极向上起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To help you think positive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.78,0:09:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天很重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today's important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.43,0:09:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 起床吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿 系那条领带比较帅 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, wear that nice tie. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.61,0:09:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要我留午饭钱吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need any money for lunch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.64,0:09:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我不需要午饭钱了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't need any money for lunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨天的还剩点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have money from yesterday's lunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.91,0:09:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢这样 不是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You love it, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.25,0:10:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的美国小玩偶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just your American boy toy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.32,0:10:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是情人兼玩偶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lover boy toy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.52,0:10:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这有多郁闷 我两次拯救世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how demoralizing it is to have saved the world twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,居然还得低声下气地去找工作?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and still be groveling for a job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.95,0:10:08.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公众可不知道你拯救过世界 山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People don't know you saved the world, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.09,0:10:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我知道 我相信你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I do. I believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,政府既然知情 就应该在华盛顿给我找份差事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The government knows. I mean, they could hook me up with a job right here in D. C.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.13,0:10:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该去跟汽车人共事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I should be working with the Autobots,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.70,0:10:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则就太不公平了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}otherwise it's not fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.93,0:10:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 他们已经供你上了大学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, they paid for your college.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总统还给你颁发了英雄勋章呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The President gave you a hero medal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.03,0:10:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 山姆 干得好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, man. Great job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.13,0:10:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这对我来说真是太酷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the coolest thing that ever happened to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.08,0:10:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 小伙子们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.38,0:10:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看这是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.42,0:10:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且 我记得那天还有更精彩的情节{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, as I recall, that wasn't even the highlight of your day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.92,0:10:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 大使先生 给 - 英国大使馆 你们是下一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Ambassador, here. - British Embassy, you're up next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.12,0:10:47.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 你不能戴着它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you don't wear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.08,0:10:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看 你必须放在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, you've gotta...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.52,0:10:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盒子里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.37,0:10:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是想戴戴嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't, even if I wanted to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.70,0:10:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把它放进盒子 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're supposed to leave it in the box, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放进去别动 瞧这盒子真漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep it in this. What a gorgeous box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.29,0:11:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 没错 我的勋章{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. My medal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.61,0:11:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道是谁给我的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know who gave that to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.91,0:11:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.68,0:11:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 博图士 - 哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- POUTS. - Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美国总统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}President of the United States.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.22,0:11:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝 不是每个人都能找到工作的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Babe, it's hard for everybody to get a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.42,0:11:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.96,0:11:19.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸妈开着房车环游世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, my parents are gonna be here in a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.36,0:11:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下星期就要来咱们这里了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on their road trip Partybus World Tour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.36,0:11:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸来了之后 要是看到我没工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If my dad gets here and I don't have a job,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.39,0:11:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定会赏我耳光的 你知道 我得行动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's gonna spank me. You know, it's go time for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.63,0:11:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧 今晚我给你安排个工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, tonight, I'll give you a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.27,0:11:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我做一顿美妙的浪漫大餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Romance me with a nice dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.64,0:11:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后 我再多给你一点小费{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and...maybe you can get that bonus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 喔... - 啊...哦...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wo... - Ah... Oh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真好看 - 把他弄出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good looking. - Get him out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.86,0:11:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.55,0:11:44.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 他真流氓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he's gross!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.25,0:11:46.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,身材真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.29,0:11:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们流落到了这里 得有人照顾他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they're stranded here. Somebody's got to watch out for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.95,0:11:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨天它还钻进了我的内衣抽屉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yesterday, that one was in my underwear drawer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.18,0:11:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,研究一下嘛 顺便大饱眼福{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did research. Looking real good, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.39,0:11:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你还真打我啊 - 我只想找个平凡的男朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you hitting, huh? - I just want a normal boyfriend..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.32,0:11:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你爱的就是我这点 不是吗? - 抱怨鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's what you love about me, isn't it? - Crybaby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.10,0:11:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没说过“爱”这个字吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I don't have the word yet..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.57,0:12:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许等你有能力分摊房租再说吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe a little bit closer when you can pay your half of the rent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.63,0:12:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.13,0:12:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一下雨就害得我短路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frinking shorting my circuits out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.57,0:12:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你太不厚道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's inhumane, what it is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.60,0:12:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们住在阳台上的小盒子里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make us live in a box...on a balcony,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.67,0:12:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟那畜生待在一块{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right next to a beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.11,0:12:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把我当成动物看待 - 闭嘴 行吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like a common animal! - Stop, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.38,0:12:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和你那丑哥们 未经允许不能进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and your creepy sidekick can't be in here without permission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁定的规矩 那个金发妞吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to who, Miss Blondie Blonde?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.85,0:12:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起来 小狗狗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up, little doggie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,驾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.19,0:12:25.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唷 小诸葛 你怎么样啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, Brains, what's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.82,0:12:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doing good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 没意思 这集我看过了是斯巴克发疯的那集{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah shoot, I'd seen this one. It's the one where Spock goes nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.76,0:12:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 我真不知道该怎么跟那妞相处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Sam, I don't know about moving in with this chick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.59,0:12:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是像上一任那样甩了咱们怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if she dumps us like the last girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.21,0:12:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她凶巴巴的 我不喜欢她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was mean. Didn't like her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.93,0:12:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们现在可得同仇敌忾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Us guys got to stick together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.78,0:12:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是一家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.39,0:12:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我们可不是一家人 你不过是外星难民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we are not family. You're a political refugee,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.21,0:12:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好不容易才找了一个欣赏我的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I have finally found someone who appreciates me for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.98,0:12:51.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你得告诉她 我们不是你的宠物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you tell her that we're not your pets,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.77,0:12:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更不是你的玩具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we're not your toys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我们是高等的天才外星种族 只想找个家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right? We're an advanced, geniusalien race just looking for a home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.12,0:13:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们可以停在这里 - 我觉得不该停{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe it wasn't such a good idea. - Didn't have to stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 他们还能怎样 拖走吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. What're they going to do, tow it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.92,0:13:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.64,0:13:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小山山{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sammy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.19,0:13:10.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 噢 别这样 这很搞笑 哈哈 - 山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, come on, that's funny. Ha ha. - Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.86,0:13:12.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想死你们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I missed you guys so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.80,0:13:14.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不想才怪呢 你觉得这身如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, you did. What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.43,0:13:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 瞧你们 - 可爱吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look at that. - Cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.07,0:13:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 看着很老 - 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You look old. - Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.50,0:13:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能看得出岁数来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel like I can see the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.57,0:13:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你的小领带 嘿 我的准儿媳妇在哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love your little tie. Hey, where's my girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.91,0:13:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们漂亮的卡莉哪去了? - 她上班去了 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's my beautiful Carly? - She's at work, Ma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.47,0:13:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她找了份新工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's got a new job. You guys said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你们一周之后才来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you were gonna be here in a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.88,0:13:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是21号 而不是11号 记得吗? 爹?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The 21st, not the 11th, Dad, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只负责把这车开过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just hauled ass in this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.72,0:13:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们快马加鞭赶过来的 - 这大家伙跑得飞快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We stopped for gas. - This thing. The love tub, it flies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.12,0:13:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 我们打扰你了没?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, are we keeping you from something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如说 你的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, say, your job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.95,0:13:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 上班时间到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's about time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:37.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该很着急吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had us worried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.72,0:13:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 我有几个面试要去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh. I have job interviews.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.49,0:13:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 很好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. That's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.83,0:13:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真杯具 - 别说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That sucks. - Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这么消极嘛 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to be so negative, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.33,0:13:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们一家人好不容易在华盛顿团聚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're here with your son and your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.34,0:13:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 应该是高兴的时候 - 真杯具你居然没工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I mean, it's a good time. - It sucks that you don't have a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.40,0:13:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有很多事可以做啊 对吧? - 就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, but there's good thingsto do here, too, right? - yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对嘛 逛逛博物馆 看看纪念碑 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right? Museums and monuments, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.17,0:13:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 晚上再见 - 我要把礼物收回{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll see you tonight. - I'm bagging the gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.21,0:13:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 面试应该穿正式点的裤子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, I think for an interview you should wear real pants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.66,0:14:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们应该天天都穿正式点的裤子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think for life, you should wear real pants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.78,0:14:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 噢 大...大黄蜂这是怎么了? - 天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, wha... what happened to Bumble Bee? - Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.51,0:14:06.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他去执行任务了 我只好拿这个当替补{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's off on his missions. I had to get this for backup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.85,0:14:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 连你的车也有工作 嗯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, your car has a job, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.00,0:14:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别说了 它能变成什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop. What does it change into?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么也不会变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't change into anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是件古董 妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a collector's item, Ma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.30,0:14:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从地摊上淘来的 开几次就好 相信我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it for a steal. It just needs some work. Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.53,0:14:18.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这车挺可爱的 让我想起了大黄蜂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I think it's darling. It reminds me a lot of Bumblebee,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.83,0:14:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是大黄蜂报废了大概就这个样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if Bumblebee were a sad piece of shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 我们送你去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, we'll give you a ride!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.24,0:14:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自从我们到来之后我们的新家 地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the years since our arrival, our new home, Earth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.12,0:14:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生了许多变化{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has seen much change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.51,0:14:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能量检测仪保卫着每个城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Energon detectors guard its cities now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.68,0:14:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,远程防御系统随时护卫领空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long-range defense systems watch the skies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.52,0:14:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(中东 非法核设施)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.37,0:14:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以现在 我们也协助盟友们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now we assist our allies,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.85,0:14:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,解决人类间的冲突{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in solving human conflicts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.36,0:14:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阻止人类彼此伤害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to prevent mankind from bringing harm to itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.83,0:14:57.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是国防部长的车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Defense Minister's car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.44,0:15:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,立即放行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bisila.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈哈 趴在地上 不许动 老实待着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haha. on the ground, per favore! And stay there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.53,0:15:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们组成秘密分队 在全球各地执行各种任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We work in secret teams on various missions around the globe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.11,0:15:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,同时 我们也在寻找宿敌...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all the while we search for signs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.64,0:15:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...卷土重来的蛛丝马迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of our true enemies' return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.31,0:15:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是沃斯霍德 乌克兰能源部法律顾问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Voshkod, General Counsel with Ukrainian Department of Energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我国政府会否认我们之间存在这次谈话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My government will officially deny that we're having this conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.72,0:15:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在一座废弃的核设施内有了意外发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At one of our decommissioned facilities, a discovery was made,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.56,0:15:57.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕是外星生物的痕迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which I fear may be alien in nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.13,0:16:02.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那座核设施的名字叫“切尔诺贝利”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The facility's name is Chernobyl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.03,0:16:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沃斯霍德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Voshkod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自1986年起这里就成了一座空城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, uninhabited since '86.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.05,0:16:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说两万年之内都不适宜人类居住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear it won't be livable again for another 20, 000 years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.22,0:16:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少两万年 乌克兰原本土壤肥沃 那真是场悲剧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least. Ukraine was the most fertile land. It's a tragedy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.46,0:16:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这边请{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.96,0:16:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做好准备 只能待60分钟 注意各自的辐射量水平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gear up! We have 60 minutes on the ground. Watch your radiation levels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.93,0:16:45.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沃斯霍德先生 你的防护衣呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Voshkod, where's your protective gear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.94,0:16:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的防护衣在哪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your protective gear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.61,0:16:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经没必要了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would not matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.78,0:16:57.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说 死是迟早的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For me, it's only a matter of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.41,0:16:59.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穿过这所学校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through the school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.68,0:17:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尤里会带你们下去 另外还有件事 上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yuri will take you below. And one other thing, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.65,0:17:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别说出去 这里进行过能源实验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In private, there were some energy experiments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 待会儿再说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ho. It can wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.61,0:17:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续前进 跟紧点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep moving. Stay tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里 我们找到了 把灯拿来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, right here. I think I found it.{\r}
