Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.34,0:22:47.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打动我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impress me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.15,0:22:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这我哪里有准备 从何说起呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You catch me off guard. I don't know where to begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.28,0:22:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打动我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impress me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.45,0:22:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有保留 随便您怎么问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm an open book. ask me any question you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.38,0:22:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就是很有野心 很强势{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're a go get a ramrod...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.70,0:22:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:22:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是个控制狂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...take-charge kind of guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.38,0:22:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个杀手 而且是冷血杀手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a killer. A stone-cold killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.22,0:22:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那在控制欲方面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, take-charge guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.61,0:23:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,掌控一切 野蛮凶狠 我人就这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take-charge, Viking, barbarian, of course, that's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.96,0:23:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您看着办吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pow! I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.27,0:23:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要的不是这种人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not looking for that here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.64,0:23:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不要马屁精 不要小人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No brown-nosing. No suck up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.17,0:23:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要仆人 我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No toolery. I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.61,0:23:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您好 布拉索斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Mr. Brazos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.08,0:23:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么尚塔尔会拿着...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is Shontel using.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.68,0:23:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...红色楼层才能用的红色杯子呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what appears to be a red cup from the red floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.52,0:23:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们这层的主题是黄色 - 马上查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- when we are on the yellow floor? - I'm on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.23,0:23:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是赤裸裸的视觉和灵魂上的背叛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a visual and, therefore, a visceral betrayal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.92,0:23:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,解决它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.73,0:23:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是个白痴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a dumbass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.39,0:23:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真恶心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disgusting!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.02,0:23:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.57,0:23:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里简直是无法无天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's total anarchy around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.97,0:23:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们电子邮件里说是招收行政人员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The... e-mail I read said administrative aide?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.65,0:23:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 是收发员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope. Mailroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.11,0:23:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.99,0:24:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道有多少常春藤名校毕业生到我们这里...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any idea how many lvy League Phi Beta Kappas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.26,0:24:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 想来碰运气 - 先生 我曾经救过你的命两次了 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- would kill to... - Mister, I saved your life twice. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.22,0:24:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是我不能告诉你时间 地点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell you how or when or why,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.82,0:24:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是经过 但我真的做过大事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I have done shit that matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.89,0:24:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我只是想再做点实事而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'd just kind of like a job where I matter again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.13,0:24:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以谢了 不管怎么样 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So thank you, but no, thank you, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.80,0:24:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我怎么想的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.56,0:24:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得先干这个 才能干其它的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want the job after this job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.50,0:24:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你眼下只有这份差事可以做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, son, this is the job that's standing in your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.68,0:24:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你一定会干得特别棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's why you're gonna be so very, very good at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.80,0:24:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为当我第一眼看到你时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause when I look at you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.11,0:24:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就想起了年轻气盛时的自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see a younger me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.24,0:24:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(华盛顿特区 NEST秘密总部)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.12,0:24:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(公共健康与社会福利部)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.89,0:24:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有在勤汽车人报到 十五分钟后开始训练{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All arriving Autobots, in par, training and debriefing in 15 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.48,0:24:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恐龙到23号车位报到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dino, report to Bay 23.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.46,0:24:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,横炮到37号车位进行武器评估{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sideswipe, Bay 37 for weapons assessment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.91,0:25:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,议员先生 您兴许知道 国家航空航天局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senator, I suggest you remember that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.11,0:25:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要资金时会找我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when the NSA wants funding, they call me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.25,0:25:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,中情局若想消灭某个目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the CIA is gonna take out a target,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.85,0:25:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也得先获得我的许可{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they ask first for my permission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.45,0:25:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总统想了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when the President wants to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.96,0:25:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪个国会参议员的政治把柄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which members of Congress are politically vulnerable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.12,0:25:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比方说 某些不为人知的罪行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in terms of, let's say, undiscovered criminal conduct,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.72,0:25:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也会打电话问我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the number he dials.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.49,0:25:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美国政府声称正在调查这宗爆炸案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}U. S. Agencies say they have been monitoring the blast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.83,0:25:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但事实上 这有可能是一次秘密的军事打击行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if, in fact, this was a covert military strike,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.78,0:25:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没有任何国家声称对此事件负责 - 中情局一再追问我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- no nation has claimed responsibility. - CIA is up my ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.99,0:25:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次的幕后玄机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about this mystery raid in the Middle East.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.03,0:25:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你给我说清楚 这和你们有关吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, it's time to come clean. Was your unit involved?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.51,0:25:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 我不能确定 女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh. I'm not sure, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.46,0:25:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 伙计们 这是在示范如何射击霸天虎的头部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, guys. This is how you do a Decepticon head kill shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.75,0:25:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做为国家情报总监{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As Director of National Intelligence,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.55,0:25:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望你回答的时候动动脑子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a really big fan of intelligent answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.46,0:25:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的没法确定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't really tell you definitively.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.35,0:25:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些汽车人就像进入了青春期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These Autobots are like teenage kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.95,0:25:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,动不动就跑出去玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They like to sneak out of the house every once in a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.64,0:25:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伦诺克斯上校 你到底是不是这里的指挥官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Lennox, are you in command or are you not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.16,0:25:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 女士 我是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, ma'am, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.68,0:25:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别叫我女士 我真是听够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop with the "ma'am". Enough with the "ma'am".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.62,0:25:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看起来有这么老吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I look like a "ma'am"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.12,0:25:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 女士 呃不 女士 只是像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, ma'am. Yes, ma'am. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.83,0:25:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这枪可是我的完美杰作 铁皮 - 不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This gunis my perfect invention, Ironhide. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.09,0:26:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 他们来了 太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, you're here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.97,0:26:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫Q 真的希望你们能对他有所交代{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me name's Que. I do hope you have answers for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.56,0:26:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没见过他如此火冒三丈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen him so upset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.00,0:26:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,擎天柱 还记得夏洛特·梅琳吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus, you remember Charlotte Mearing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.37,0:26:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的国家情报总监{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our Director of National Intelligence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.80,0:26:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他情绪不太好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in a bad mood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.61,0:26:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天不想和任何人说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not talking to anybody today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.51,0:26:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这算什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.69,0:26:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无声的抗议吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the silent treatment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.94,0:26:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那个我们知道 - 这跟那不是一码事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We've seen that and this is not that. - Definitely not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.75,0:26:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比那还严重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.59,0:26:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,擎天柱 你总得有所表示吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prime! Make something of yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.22,0:26:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他都气疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's pissed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.53,0:26:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你骗了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lied to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.96,0:26:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们说过 一切有关我们星球的情报都会告诉我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything humans know of our planet we were told had all been shared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.17,0:26:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那这东西为什么会在人类的手里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why was this found in human possession?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.17,0:26:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们起初也蒙在鼓里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were in the dark on this also.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.34,0:26:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事目前在第7区也只有局长知情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was Director Only clearance at Sector 7 until now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.44,0:26:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的皮包{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.85,0:26:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪个皮包?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which bag?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.74,0:26:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱马仕铂金包 绿色鸵鸟皮的那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Herm. Birkin. Green ostrich!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.61,0:26:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.28,0:26:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个秘密只有极少数人知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a secret few men knew,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.89,0:26:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,目前在世的更是没几个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and fewer still remain alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.42,0:27:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,容我向你介绍一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allow me to please introduce to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.16,0:27:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两位国家航空航天局的行动组要员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two of NASA's founding mission directors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.66,0:27:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及宇航员巴兹·奥尔德林博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and astronaut Dr. Buzz Aldrin,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.96,0:27:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是当年首次登月的两位人类先驱之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one of the first two men to step foot on the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.55,0:27:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.93,0:27:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位是擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus Prime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.07,0:27:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你我都曾遨游太空 很荣幸见到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From a fellow space traveler, it's a true honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.17,0:27:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见到您我也很荣幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The honor is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.73,0:27:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在60年代的整个太空军备竞赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our entire space race of the 1960s, it appears,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.15,0:27:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全都是针对一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was in response to an event.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.34,0:27:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的宇航员调查了一艘坠毁的外星飞船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our astronauts investigated a crashed alien ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.35,0:27:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但并未发现幸存者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No survivors onboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.05,0:27:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上头要求我们严守秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were sworn to secrecy by our Commander in Chief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.29,0:27:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这项任务绝不能对任何人透露{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was a mission you will never speak of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.16,0:27:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.83,0:27:44.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在国家航空航天局 也只有35个人知道这计划的真相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A total of 35 people knew the real plan at NASA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.63,0:27:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏联成功发射了无人登月探测器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soviets managed to land unmanned probes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.12,0:27:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们大概是在那时取走了那根燃料棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somehow they must have picked up that fuel rod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.89,0:27:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们相信苏联人发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We believe the Russians deduced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.38,0:27:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那燃料棒可以进行核裂变反应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the rod was a fissionable fuel assembly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.61,0:27:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并在切尔诺贝利核电站对其进行实验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}believed they had it mastered, and tried to harness it at Chernobyl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.72,0:28:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们共组织了6次登月行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We landed six missions in all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.08,0:28:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拍下了数百幅照片 采集了样本{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We took hundreds of photos and samples.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.08,0:28:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并将其永久封存{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We locked them away forever,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.68,0:28:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之后探月计划便终止了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the moon program was shut down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.42,0:28:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们搜查过防撞逃生舱吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, did you search the crash vault?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.63,0:28:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那艘飞船名叫“方舟”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ship's name was the Ark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.53,0:28:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾亲眼看着它逃离塞伯坦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I watched it escape Cybertron myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.84,0:28:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,船上携带了一项汽车人的核心科技{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was carrying an Autobot technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.88,0:28:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本可以帮助我们赢得战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which would have won us the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.43,0:28:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有那艘船的船长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And its captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.25,0:28:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 船长是谁? - 伟大的御天敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who was its captain? - The great Sentinel Prime,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.51,0:28:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那项技术的发明者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the technology's inventor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.24,0:28:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他也是汽车人的超级领袖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was commander of the Autobots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.71,0:28:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的前任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.15,0:28:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须找到方舟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's imperative that I find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.00,0:28:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抢在霸天虎之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the Decepticons learn of its location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.13,0:28:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们汽车人的宇宙飞船有能力飞往月球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our Autobot spacecraft has the ability to get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.29,0:28:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 你们必须祈祷这还来得及{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you must pray it's in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.04,0:29:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 我找卡莉·斯宾塞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. I'm here to see Carly Spencer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.11,0:29:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.86,0:29:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你找到工作了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got the job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.15,0:29:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 简直不可思议 - 你真的找到了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is crazy. - You really got it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.35,0:29:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 - 看 我怎么说的来的? 兔子给你好运气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - See, what did I tell you? It's the bunny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.95,0:29:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你太受欢迎了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are so welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.70,0:29:23.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是不是更爱我了? - 好感度上升了点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you like me more? - A little bit, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.96,0:29:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只说你管这博物馆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you were his assistant curator,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.26,0:29:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没说你有这么个宝贝啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you didn't say the guy owns Space Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.84,0:29:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吧 这里很漂亮吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. Isn't it beautiful in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.16,0:29:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且 我老板也是个超酷的家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's the coolest guy. Ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.90,0:29:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是吗? - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.00,0:29:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.10,0:29:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪伦·古尔德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan Gould.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.40,0:29:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.24,0:29:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幸会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A pleasure to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.24,0:29:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幸会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pleasure meeting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.50,0:29:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡莉经常提起你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carly's told me a lot about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.22,0:29:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 她也常跟我提起您 这里真的挺漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, vice versa. It's a beautiful building you got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.45,0:29:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像《星际迷航》里的布景{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like the Starship Enterprise in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.05,0:29:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过奖 这里也漏雨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much. It leaks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.65,0:29:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在卡莉来帮忙打理之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before Carly came to help run the collection,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.99,0:29:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这整个场馆还是一团糟呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was just a complete mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.64,0:29:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在装修工作总算重回正轨了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now, the restorations are back on track.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.72,0:29:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要去圆石滩巡展{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to Pebble Beach this year,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.25,0:29:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再赢一座奖杯回来 放在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we're gonna get a trophy for that stand right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.02,0:29:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道为什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.23,0:30:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为眼前这位小美女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because this woman right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.59,0:30:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是我的秘密武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is my secret weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.55,0:30:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 - 古尔德先生 别这样 您过奖了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. - Mr. Gould, please, you exaggerate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.60,0:30:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是负责组织工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I've done is get you organized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.98,0:30:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 你的功劳可多得多呢 我的公爵夫人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done much more than that, my Duchess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.34,0:30:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用昵称 有意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nicknames, that's fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.14,0:30:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 公爵夫人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. The Duchess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.43,0:30:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她人见人爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's adorable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.92,0:30:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把她从英国大使馆挖过来时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, when I stole her away from the British Embassy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.38,0:30:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对她说 治国有何难?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, "It's easy to manage a country".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.70,0:30:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不如来管理无价的艺术收藏品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Try managing a priceless collection of art".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.08,0:30:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这辆1939年出厂的德拉哈耶-165型敞篷跑车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a lookat this 1939 Delahaye 165 Cabriolet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.59,0:30:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,法国人设计的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Designed by a Frenchman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.38,0:30:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧她的曲线 如此优雅 不是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the curves. Elegant, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.22,0:30:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美丽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.23,0:30:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,性感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sensual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.89,0:30:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如同窈窕淑女的曲线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Built to evoke the body of the ideal woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.13,0:30:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.50,0:30:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲只靠一张破烂书桌和一个梦想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad had a $ 10 desk and a dream,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.67,0:30:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就建立了一个商业帝国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he built it into an empire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.62,0:30:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 吼吼 哇哦 - 我们现在是全美最大的会计事务所{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hoho Wow. - We're the largest accounting firm in the U. S.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.24,0:30:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他去世之后我从创投部门开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I started up the venture side after he passed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.24,0:30:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,投资未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Invest in the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.78,0:30:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,试着把赌注压到获胜者的那一方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try and bet on the winners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.21,0:30:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而收集名车能帮助我在赌局中保持理智{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, collecting cars helps me keep my sanity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.55,0:31:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys look great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.30,0:31:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 那天确实不错 古尔德先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. That was a great day, Mr. Gould.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.83,0:31:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我没见过这张 - 我也没看过呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I haven't seen that one. - No. Me, neither.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.82,0:31:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,牛仔裤太紧了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeans are tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.36,0:31:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 又来了 又是这套{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Here we go. Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.40,0:31:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你都看见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see that?{\r}
