Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.02,0:46:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在开玩笑吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.25,0:46:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手 住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, they've got guns!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.33,0:46:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我抓住他了 - 大黄蜂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got him. Go! - Bee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.96,0:46:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大黄蜂 你在吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Bee in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.41,0:46:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, all right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.93,0:46:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们就是这样对待汽车人吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This how you treat Autobots?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.53,0:46:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是自己人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on the same team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.63,0:46:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你将来在7-11便利店打工愉快 白痴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, enjoy your next job at 7-11, dickhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.27,0:46:37.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 说得没错 - 浑球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's right. - A-hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.43,0:46:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的车呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's your car now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.14,0:46:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那才是我的车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.51,0:46:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.98,0:46:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.09,0:46:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说吧 山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.18,0:46:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.78,0:46:58.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们的秘密行动很重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know your black ops stuff is important to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.42,0:47:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我并没有轻视 也不想让你内疚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not trying to diminish it or guilt-trip you or anything,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.59,0:47:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可我再也没见过你的面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just never see you anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.19,0:47:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就不能回车库待一晚上吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't come to the garage and just hang out one night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.69,0:47:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 这话让我好难过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam. That makes me feel bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.63,0:47:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我希望你感到难过 你应该感到难过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you feel bad. You should feel bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.60,0:47:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看我现在开的这辆破车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the jalopy I'm driving now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.51,0:47:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我每天都感到难过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel bad every single day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.33,0:47:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你们两个都过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, let's go, both of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.73,0:47:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伦诺克斯要见你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lennox wants to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.83,0:47:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么? 你们不再扣留我们了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, we not good enough for you anymore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.24,0:47:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 他们过于粗暴了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, babe. They were very rude, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.57,0:47:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得给我去修车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're fixing my car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.38,0:47:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为会没事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.98,0:47:22.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还要举手检测{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raise your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.40,0:47:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你今天被疯狂的飞行杀手影印机追杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you hada flying psycho-ninja copier trying to kill you today!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.08,0:47:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的黄铜拳釦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are my brass knuckles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.44,0:47:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的脚环 需要我脱掉吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my anklet. Do I have to take that off, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.18,0:47:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脚趾环呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my toe rings?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.62,0:47:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本层展物全部撤走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All NEST officials clear the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.34,0:47:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,距离接触行动 还有10分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have 10 minutes until attempted contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.95,0:47:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们获得了五件仪器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've taken possession of the five devices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.89,0:47:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,藏在御天敌飞船里的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that were hidden in the shipwith Sentinel Prime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.63,0:47:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它们都是某种汽车人科技的原型机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're some kind of prototype Autobot technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.93,0:47:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们说 御天敌相当于汽车人的爱因斯坦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say Sentinel was the Einstein of his civilization,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.09,0:47:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们要锁好这些东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we're gonna keep these locked up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.30,0:47:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是在搞清它们的用处之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until we know what we're dealing with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.14,0:47:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在任何人不得入内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now, no one gets access.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.67,0:47:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 任何人 - 今天早上 有个姓王的家伙认出了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No one. - This Wang guy recognized me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.87,0:47:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他让我来警告你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told me to warn you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.78,0:47:55.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且还提到了月之暗面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was talking about the dark side of the moon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.11,0:47:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 然后他们杀了他 - 等一下 你说月球?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- then they killed him. - Wait a minute. He mentioned the moon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.11,0:47:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 月之暗面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, dark side of the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.58,0:48:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霸天虎为什么要暗杀人类?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why would Decepticons want to kill humans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.95,0:48:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他们的对手应该是汽车人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought their war was with the Autobots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.24,0:48:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时他做了一份报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that is when he made his first quick-look science report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.38,0:48:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我想要的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what we want...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.20,0:48:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这女孩是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's the chick? Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.54,0:48:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打扰了 伦诺克斯上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me! Colonel Lennox?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.14,0:48:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梅琳主任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Director Mearing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.64,0:48:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位是山姆·维特维奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is Sam Witwicky...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.90,0:48:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 一个平民... - 我认识他 上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A civilian c... - I know his name, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.68,0:48:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道谁给了他许可?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna know who gave him clearance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.01,0:48:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁给了我许可? 擎天柱行不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who gave me clearance? How about Optimus Prime,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.98,0:48:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时他跑到我们那里寻找我家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when he touched down in suburbia looking for my house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.86,0:48:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位是国家情报处主任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the National Intelligence Director.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.33,0:48:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不知道的话...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In case you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.85,0:48:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗨 - 藐视联邦官员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi. - Disrespecting a federal officer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.10,0:48:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就够你受的了 她是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe that'll get you somewhere. Who's she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.16,0:48:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是我女友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's my girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.43,0:48:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这算什么 约会吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this, like, a date?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.16,0:48:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汽车人的事她全知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She knows all about the Autobots, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.06,0:48:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她知道大黄蜂 她来自一个军人家庭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She knows Bumblebee. And she comes from a military family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.36,0:48:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以为她担保{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can vouch for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.27,0:48:38.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我有主意了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I have an idea. How about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.43,0:48:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是谈谈正事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we get back to the important topics,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.80,0:48:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如 我今天差点就被一个霸天虎砍了头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like the fact that I almost had my face cut off by a Decepticon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.47,0:48:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做为一名纳税人 我想我可以抗议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a taxpayer, I'd like to lodge a complaint,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.01,0:48:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 事实上... - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- as a matter of fact. - Okay,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.15,0:48:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lis. listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.92,0:48:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆办公室的一名软件工程师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the software engineers at Sam's office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.57,0:48:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天被暗杀了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was murdered today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.57,0:48:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他参与过国家航空航天局的探月项目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was involved in NASA's lunar mapping probe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.58,0:48:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,情况是这样 伦诺克斯上校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the thing, Colonel Lennox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.80,0:48:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能把国家安全交付给这些年轻人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot entrust national security to teenagers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.11,0:48:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非我违反政策文件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless I missed a policy paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.07,0:48:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能让这种事发生吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we doing that now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.13,0:49:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.76,0:49:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎你是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.23,0:49:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你敢泄露你所看到的一切 那怕一个字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you breathe a word of what you've seen here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.01,0:49:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你将会因叛国罪而坐牢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will do time for treason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.98,0:49:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白我的话吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.71,0:49:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只听汽车人的命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take my orders from the Autobots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.18,0:49:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认识他们 我不认识你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know them, I don't know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.72,0:49:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.64,0:49:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,御天敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sentinel Prime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.25,0:49:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他靠能量生存 但现在没能量了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These things run on Energon, and he's out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.76,0:49:20.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他现在处于休眠状态{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in asort of a sleep mode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.96,0:49:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们开始吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.37,0:49:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是伟大的领导矩阵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the great Matrix of Leadership.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.89,0:49:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他手里有宇宙中绝无仅有的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He holds the only thing in the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.50,0:49:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有它才能给变形金刚的火种补充能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that can repower a Transformer's spark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.71,0:49:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难以置信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.04,0:49:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,御天敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sentinel Prime,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.08,0:49:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请你醒来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we bid you return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.08,0:49:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,复仇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.59,0:49:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 - 住手 别开火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Hold your fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.26,0:50:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 御天敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Sentinel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.15,0:50:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别开火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.33,0:50:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我 擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is I, Optimus Prime!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.56,0:50:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.87,0:50:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你很安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.07,0:50:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么可害怕的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nothing to fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.14,0:50:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.97,0:50:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到家了 御天敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are home, Sentinel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.25,0:50:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,战争呢 战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The war... The war!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.10,0:50:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,战争失败了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The war was lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.20,0:50:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,塞伯坦成了一片废墟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cybertron is now but a barren wasteland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.72,0:50:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们逃难到了地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have taken refuge here, on planet Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.55,0:50:35.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的人类是我们的盟友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's human race is our ally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.45,0:50:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的飞船呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.86,0:50:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们冲破战火而来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We came under fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.41,0:50:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能量柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pillars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.78,0:50:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能量柱在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are the pillars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.42,0:50:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你救出了5根{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved five of them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.32,0:50:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,包括主控柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including the control pillar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.18,0:50:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有5根?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only five?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.28,0:50:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们曾经有数百根{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We once had hundreds!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.99,0:50:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 先生们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.25,0:50:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以问一下 你们在开发的是什么技术?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask, what is this technology you're looking for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.16,0:50:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它具有重塑宇宙的能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the ability to reshape the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.03,0:50:59.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能量柱结合在一起就可以形成太空桥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together the pillars form a space bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.84,0:51:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我设计的 只有我一个人才能操作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I designed, and I alone, can control it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.60,0:51:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它违背了你们的物理定律{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It defies your laws of physics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.64,0:51:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能够超时空传送物质{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to transport matter through time and space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.49,0:51:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们说的是一种远程传送装置 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're talking about a teleportation device, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.42,0:51:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 可以传送资源 难民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, for resources, for refugees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.53,0:51:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难民或者士兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Refugees, or troops of soldiers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.80,0:51:18.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,武器 甚至炸弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}weapons, maybe bombs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.29,0:51:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一种瞬间袭击的手段{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A means of an instant strike,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.71,0:51:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是它的军事用途 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's its military function, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.21,0:51:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的技术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is our technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.66,0:51:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,必须拿回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it must be returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.55,0:51:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 得人类同意才行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. If humans say so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.10,0:51:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不能随便把大规模杀伤性武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't just bring weapons of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.84,0:51:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带入我们的大气层{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}mass destruction into our atmosphere!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.05,0:51:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少要先申报海关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kind of have to clear customs first!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.70,0:51:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还要走一些官方手续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little formality called paperwork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.62,0:51:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我们和动物之间的区别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}kind of separates us from the animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.12,0:51:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你如果能够充分尊重我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will overlook your condescending tone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.69,0:51:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就原谅你的趾高气昂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you heed the gravity of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.45,0:51:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霸天虎不知道太空桥在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Decepticons must never know the space bridge is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.75,0:51:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦入他们手中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For in their hands,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.32,0:51:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是你们的世界末日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it would mean the end of your world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.39,0:51:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“头号威胁”文件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Total Nightmare" file.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.68,0:51:56.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,调查行动开始了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, the investigation is open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.87,0:51:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会派探员去你的办公室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've sent agents to your office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.85,0:51:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 我们打算{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, for the time being,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.83,0:52:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,派汽车人护送你们回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're gonna send you home with Autobot protection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.13,0:52:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该和谁谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do I need to speak to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.26,0:52:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才能让你们明白我能帮上忙?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to get you guys to understand that I can help,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.44,0:52:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以尽一份力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I can contribute?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.70,0:52:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 我们都能帮忙 告诉我你知道什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, we can all help. Want to tell you what I know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.25,0:52:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你太阳系里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could tell you about the solar system,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.26,0:52:10.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去过的有趣星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all the fun planets to hang out in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.80,0:52:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托从我桌子上下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off my desk, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.79,0:52:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔 居然掏枪 算了 我不想帮你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, you pulling out guns. Okay, can't help you on that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.85,0:52:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.87,0:52:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们想要我干什么? 让我回家去工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you envision for me? I go home now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.55,0:52:19.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我回去玩影印机是吗? 我是说.{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I go back to work? I make copies? I mean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.48,0:52:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个组织的成员都是些老探员和特种部队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a unit for veteran intelligence officers and Special Forces,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.28,0:52:25.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可不是有特殊汽车的男孩来的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not for boys who once owned special cars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.78,0:52:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有点刻薄了吧 女士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a bit harsh, isn't it, ma'am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.72,0:52:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要叫我女士 我不是女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't call me ma'am. I'm not a ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.32,0:52:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是女的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're a woman, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.43,0:52:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.22,0:52:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些是你的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are those yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.43,0:52:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 中情局发的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.03,0:52:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我之所以问是因为我也有奖章{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only ask 'cause I also have a medal,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.40,0:52:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总统发的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the President.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.46,0:52:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.25,0:52:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 那我就不兜圈子明说吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, it's not that complicated, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.70,0:52:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有我同意 谁都不能和汽车人合作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one gets to work with the Autobots unless I approve it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.21,0:52:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你破坏了我的指挥程序{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're breaking my chain of command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.62,0:52:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.12,0:52:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能做的都做了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done what you came for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.78,0:52:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说 小伙子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With all due respect, young man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.41,0:52:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我感谢你做的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I appreciate what you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.81,0:52:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不是军人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're not a soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.05,0:52:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只是个送信的 永远都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a messenger. You've always been a messenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.18,0:53:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.69,0:53:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大黄蜂 你去坐货运电梯 我们楼上见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee, you take the freight elevator. I'll see you up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.46,0:53:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 真是鬼扯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, this blows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.76,0:53:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那个女人把我们踢出来了 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That lady officially kicked us out. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.50,0:53:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,证人保护程序烂透了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Witness Protection Program sucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.44,0:53:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说得不错 但有大黄蜂在至少我们更安全了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but we're a whole lot safer with big yellow and his cannons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.79,0:53:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那条狗可保护不了咱们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That dog can't protect crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.87,0:53:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大黄蜂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.00,0:53:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想出去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You miss hanging out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.30,0:53:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我也想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, me, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.00,0:53:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人 她说我是个送信的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That woman, she called me a messenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.53,0:53:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们能相信吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you believe that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.04,0:53:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,忙了半天 我只是个送信的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After everything I've done, I'm a messenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.44,0:53:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我相信你山姆 说实话我们也有同感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I believe it. I tell ya, Sammy, we feel the same way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.34,0:53:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个星球上的人都不懂得尊重别人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The disrespect on this rock is criminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.24,0:53:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该做点什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should do something about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.14,0:53:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大黄蜂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.35,0:53:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要知道他们为什么追杀人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to know why they're killing humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.35,0:54:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们得找个专家问问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say we call in the expert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.72,0:54:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下一位嘉宾是前美国情报人员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My next guest is a former American intelligence operative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.56,0:54:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他曾为我们爆出猛料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who has dared to speak out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.45,0:54:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,揭露了我们国家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}regarding our alleged military alliance with what many describe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.99,0:54:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和所谓的外星僱佣兵之间的军事同盟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as a groupof extraterrestrial mercenaries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.49,0:54:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就是畅销书《代号-英雄》的作者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is the author of the bestselling book, Code-Name Hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.20,0:54:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有请前探员西摩·西蒙斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Former special agent, Seymour Simmons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.12,0:54:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比尔 粉丝们 很高兴接受专访{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bill. Big fan. Great to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.74,0:54:24.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,西蒙斯探员 你想让我们相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Agent Simmons, you would have us believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.79,0:54:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对我们来说最要紧的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that it is in our best interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.76,0:54:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是在这场外星人内战中选好阵营 是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to formally take sidesin this so-called alien civil war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.20,0:54:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其中一派想把我们剁了做早餐吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the other side wanted to spank us for breakfast,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.93,0:54:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 我们其实没什么选择余地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I wouldn't exactly call it a toss-up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.38,0:54:36.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些霸天虎相当凶残{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These Decepticons are lethal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.05,0:54:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但民调显示 世界上一半的人都认为会更加安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But polls show half the world would feel safer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.02,0:54:41.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让汽车人离开地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the Autobots completely gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.99,0:54:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们滚出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get them out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.24,0:54:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不需要他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't need them here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.79,0:54:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那为了安全 我只能抱着手榴弹睡觉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel safer when I sleep with a hand grenade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.90,0:54:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这话未必对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't mean I'm always right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.29,0:54:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,探员先生 事实上我们得到了关于你的资料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, agent, here at The Factor we have obtained documents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.26,0:54:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是被情报委员会开除的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that show you were fired...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.58,0:54:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 查斯 我在做访谈 - 抱歉 西蒙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Chaz, I'm doing an interview. - Sorry, Mr. Simmons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.67,0:54:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是机构裁员 经费削减了...查斯 滚出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Downsized, Bill. Budget cuts. Chaz, out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.50,0:55:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是你的精神检验报告上面说 你有严重的妄想倾向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your psych evaluation reports "severe delusional tendencies".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.62,0:55:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是搞突袭啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is ambush journalism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.97,0:55:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想了解外星人联盟的真相吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want the truth about the alien alliance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.74,0:55:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,买我的书吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buy my book!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.48,0:55:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来买我的书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buy my book,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.35,0:55:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不然就没有了 各位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before it's too late, people!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.01,0:55:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想跟我单挑是吧 比尔?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want a piece of me, Bill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.04,0:55:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 想把我剥个精光? 我恭候大驾 - 哇哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want to get naked? I'm ready! - Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.50,0:55:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,采访结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interview is over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.42,0:55:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来就像个傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're sounding like a pinhead, agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.05,0:55:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我给你个忠告吧 - 都结束了 懂不懂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And I've got a suggestion for you. - It's over. Understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.30,0:55:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赶快去看医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damage control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.23,0:55:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 达奇 - 你们明显惹恼了西蒙斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dutch! - You have obviously upset Mr. Simmons!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.63,0:55:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,23秒之内你们必须离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have 23 seconds to leave the property.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.90,0:55:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经叫警察了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have called the police!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.40,0:55:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这群乡巴佬真是自不量力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are peasant people throwing rocks at a giant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.07,0:55:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来呢 有什么安排?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up next? What have we got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.23,0:55:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,中午在市中心签售{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Book signing, Midtown, noon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.74,0:55:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后和探索频道洽谈您的真人秀节目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we pitch your reality show to the Discovery Channel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.03,0:55:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 还有那个谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and I had this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.70,0:55:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维特维奇今天给您打了5次电话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Witwicky who keeps calling me. Five times today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.34,0:55:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那小子想干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid? What does he want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.57,0:55:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霸天虎又回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I called you because the Decepticons are back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.12,0:55:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想求你帮忙查清原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to know why, and I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.65,0:55:40.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们回来了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.65,0:55:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这下又有钱赚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's good for business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.50,0:55:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想不想知道一个 隐藏了50年的外星机密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I told you I know a 50-year-old alien secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.22,0:55:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人知道的秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that nobody ever told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.05,0:55:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你别再引诱我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not tempt my addiction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.99,0:55:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经金盆洗手了 孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have gone through withdrawal, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.12,0:55:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达奇 这条线路安全吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dutch, is this line secure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.60,0:55:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.13,0:55:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别冒险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't take the risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.83,0:55:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在有钱了 我图什么啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm rich, why should I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.43,0:56:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要再复出了 绝不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not relapse. I won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.27,0:56:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别让让心中的恶魔卷土重来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not let the demons win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.84,0:56:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.44,0:56:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么样的...机密?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of... secret?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.61,0:56:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿波罗 月亮 外星人 伪装{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo. Moon. Aliens. Cover-up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.18,0:56:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,未来技术 暗杀 这类的机密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Future tech. Assassinations. That kind of stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.18,0:56:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 阿波罗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Apollo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.68,0:56:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dutch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.62,0:56:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉威震天 哥重出江湖了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell Megatron, "Let's tango".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.40,0:56:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这颗星球多么壮丽而祥和啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So majestic and peaceful, this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.21,0:56:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪像塞伯坦的末日景象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unlike the final days of Cybertron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.64,0:56:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经想过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've wondered what might have been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.39,0:56:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当初若是由您来指挥最后一战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you had fought the final battle,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.86,0:56:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}instead of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.80,0:56:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别追悔过去 年轻的战士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mourn the past, young warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.49,0:57:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多亏了你 我们的种族才得以延续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks to you, our race survives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.52,0:57:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您曾是我们的超级领袖 御天敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were our leader, Sentinel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.84,0:57:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您有权再次领导我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is your right to lead us again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.00,0:57:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这个我不熟悉的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a world I do not know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.47,0:57:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不再是你的老师了 擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am no longer your teacher, Optimus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.64,0:57:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你才是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.26,0:57:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事得查个水落石出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to break this case down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.88,0:57:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宇航员倒霉也能传染{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we have here is an astronaut epidemic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.89,0:57:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失踪 死亡 交通事故 谋杀 送医不治 车祸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MIA. Dead. Died in a car accident. Killed. DOA. Car death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.48,0:57:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像是这些家伙不会开车 但却能都让飞船开上天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like these guys can't drive. They can fly into outer space,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.79,0:57:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,居然开不好车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they can't drive a car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.29,0:57:35.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你要的情报 维特维奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Procured your information, Witwicky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.62,0:57:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 布鲁斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.66,0:57:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.88,0:57:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看一眼 就这一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me see one right now. One time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.40,0:57:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 要快 - 没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Quick. - Very.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.35,0:57:51.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,探月轨道飞行器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lunar Reconnaissance Orbiter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.57,0:57:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,国家航空航天局于2009年发射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It says NASA launched it in 2009.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.35,0:57:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,庭审记录显示 杰瑞可能篡改了代码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, forensics show Wang may have messed with the code,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.36,0:57:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,导致无法测绘月球远端{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}preventing it from mapping the far side of the moon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.01,0:58:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是月球背面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is also the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.74,0:58:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太酷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.95,0:58:03.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们搞渗透 搞恐吓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They infiltrate us, intimidate us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.68,0:58:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,逼迫人类给他们干肮脏勾当{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}coerce us to do their dirty work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.52,0:58:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦事成呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And once they're done,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.15,0:58:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,砰 砰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dushhhh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.72,0:58:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就毫不犹豫杀人灭口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a double-tap to the cerebellum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.49,0:58:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说 有人类在为霸天虎做事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So humans are working for the Decepticons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.02,0:58:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得霸天虎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think this is about the Decepticons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.32,0:58:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是在月球上找什么东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}looking for something on the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.50,0:58:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他们是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's about something...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.76,0:58:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...要隐藏什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they wanted to hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.67,0:58:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟老爸玩玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.17,0:58:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 过两招{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, throw down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.30,0:58:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你小时候是不是脑袋让驴踢了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you eat a lot of paint chips when you were a kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.96,0:58:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真胡闹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.38,0:58:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哈 喜欢吗? - 后退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ha. Like it? - Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.46,0:58:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来教你两招...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll teach you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.88,0:58:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.16,0:58:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在召开一个外星人情报高端分析会议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are having a pretty high-level alien intel confab here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.53,0:58:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你没有资格参加{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I don't think you're cleared for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.02,0:58:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 跑腿的 - 没错 你说得对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Errand boy. - Yeah, you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.76,0:58:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这机器人真给力 - 布鲁斯 你该走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a bitching robot. - I think it's time to go, Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.43,0:58:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢你让我开了眼界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you so much for this. And...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.66,0:58:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 布鲁斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got to go, Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.03,0:58:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 我忙得浑身冒烟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I'm smokin' over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.20,0:58:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关于那些失踪的苏联宇航员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now with the missing Russian cosmonauts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.10,0:59:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前苏联曾经取消了一次载人登月计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turns out the Soviets canceled a manned mission to the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.00,0:59:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是1972年的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The moon, in 1972.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.41,0:59:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后来其中两名宇航员潜逃到了美国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And two of their cosmonauts went into hiding in America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.08,0:59:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚发现了他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I just found them alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.81,0:59:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是个天才 小诸葛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a genius, Brains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.02,0:59:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看你干的好事 大黄蜂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was smooth, Bumblebee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.86,0:59:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就差那么一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missed it by that much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.56,0:59:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.33,0:59:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁能告诉我这是怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would somebody care to tell me what the hell's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.33,0:59:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.60,0:59:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是谁? - 居然问我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - Who am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.17,0:59:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那谁...达奇 搜她的身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is that? Dutch! Frisk her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.90,0:59:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,遵命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.65,0:59:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.50,0:59:37.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dutch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.60,0:59:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别碰我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.20,0:59:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我也没打算碰你 - 山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not gonna touch you. - Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.24,0:59:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.78,0:59:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, I was working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.74,0:59:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.98,0:59:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 又要无家可归了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. We're homeless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.01,0:59:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她住在这里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She lives here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.01,0:59:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.02,0:59:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真该搜她身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had your chance to frisk her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.08,0:59:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有女友的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.98,0:59:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗? 那她叫什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? What's her name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.79,0:59:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,印蒂亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Innn...dia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.66,0:59:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要去参加迪伦的晚会 忘了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're supposed to be at Dylan's party, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.72,1:00:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没忘 但这些人是我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do remember, but these are my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.33,1:00:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们需要我 我现在走不开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need me. I have to be here right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.83,1:00:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样? 汽车人和军方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what, the Autobots and the military,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.10,1:00:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能自己解决问题吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they can't handle this on their own?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.46,1:00:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道我为什么喜欢你的战争故事吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I liked about your war stories, Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.27,1:00:08.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为它们仅仅是故事而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's that they were stories,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.67,1:00:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都过去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they were in the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.77,1:00:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我知道你又想起你牺牲的哥哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I know you're thinking about your brother, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.30,1:00:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在想你的家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're thinking about your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.84,1:00:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在情况不同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's not that situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.22,1:00:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不同吗? - 很不同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.17,1:00:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么不同?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.21,1:00:17.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我怎么不同?山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why isn't it, Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.21,1:00:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我们拿奖章好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think we'd rather have his medals,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.28,1:00:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是看到他活着好?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or we'd rather have him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.15,1:00:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对 我明白了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear you. I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.05,1:00:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要带我的幸运兔去哪? 站住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you taking my bunny? Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.05,1:00:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你先别走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just stop for a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.49,1:00:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我昨晚能睡得着吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I could sleep last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.25,1:00:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我总算想明白了 山姆就是喜欢冒险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then it hit me. No, Sam wants to be in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.49,1:00:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不然他都不知道自己是谁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't know who he is without it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.66,1:00:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想让你看得起我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.03,1:00:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看得起你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You matter to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.87,1:00:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你很担心 你非常担心我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're worried. I know you're worried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.50,1:00:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我向你保证 我会照顾好自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I promise you, I can handle this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.10,1:00:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能保证吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you? You can promise it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.94,1:00:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.98,1:00:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 我不想失去你 我知道结果会怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, I don't want to lose you, and I know where this leads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.48,1:00:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没心理准备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not ready for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.92,1:01:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我一起去吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you coming with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.05,1:01:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.89,1:01:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.99,1:01:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.82,1:01:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的兔脚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's your foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.23,1:01:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真正的勇士总是独来独往{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The warrior's path is a solitary one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.93,1:01:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 她怎么买得起那种车?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell did she afford that car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.73,1:01:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 老板送的 - 有钱的混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Her boss. - Rich bastards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.27,1:01:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以前我也讨厌他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to hate them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.54,1:01:40.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在嘛...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, it's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.74,1:01:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去黑帮追查两名前苏联宇航员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going to a gig on the hunt for two Russian cosmonauts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.31,1:01:47.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么也比不上开迈巴赫拉风 是吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing like driving in a Maybach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.18,1:01:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,德国人造的车没得说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Germans know how to make cars, let me tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.95,1:01:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的小达奇 原国家安全局的网络讯息高手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Dutchman, former NSA cybersleuth extraordinaire,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.97,1:01:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他查到他们就在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tracked them down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.82,1:02:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这些宇航员要躲藏起来? 为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, these cosmonautswent into hiding. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.63,1:02:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发现目标 完全吻合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bingo. I got a match.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.47,1:02:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达奇 你真是头德国牧羊犬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a German Shepherd, Dutch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.00,1:02:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,俄国人有个毛病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The thing about Russians is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.58,1:02:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是不爱多说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they never like to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.27,1:02:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得用点国际通用语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna take a little of the "international language".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.51,1:02:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等会见 - 那意思是再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dos vedanya. - That means "good-bye".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.98,1:02:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来点带劲的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give a spunky remark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.86,1:02:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.66,1:02:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁来引领革命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's to get revolution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.66,1:02:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个名人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A famous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.72,1:02:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dutch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.19,1:02:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我来句狠话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me something tough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.88,1:02:43.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 巴雷什尼科夫 - 我们会说英语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Baryshnikov. - We do speak English.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.62,1:02:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达奇 你真丢人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dutch, you suck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.08,1:02:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全是斯拉夫语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a Cyrillic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.70,1:02:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是字母{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}alphabet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.34,1:02:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像高级电脑上那些生僻按键{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like all the buttons you never push on a calculator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.27,1:02:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不丢人呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't suck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.74,1:02:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是西摩·西蒙斯特工来自第8区 过去的第7区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent Seymour Simmons, Sector Eight, formerly Seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.18,1:02:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道你们是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know who you are,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.65,1:02:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前苏联宇航员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cosmonautchiks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.55,1:03:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.22,1:03:04.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们本来要执行一次登陆月球背面的任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were supposed to travel to the dark side of the moon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.69,1:03:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但最终任务取消了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then it all got shut down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.19,1:03:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The question is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.13,1:03:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.77,1:03:14.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这三个人脑子有毛病吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are these three people out of their mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.33,1:03:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁放他们进来的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who let them in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.63,1:03:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“我的孩子能在这里抽烟吗?”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Can my child smoke in here?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.76,1:03:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些人我都不认识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.25,1:03:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们怎么进来的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did they come in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.33,1:03:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么知道?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did I know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.00,1:03:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快叫人来 快快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, come, quick up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.60,1:03:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,动手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.81,1:03:28.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 没问题 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, all right. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.38,1:03:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来啊 开枪啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, shoot me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.26,1:03:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来这里想干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want form here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.04,1:03:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以为国捐躯 你行吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm willing to die for my country. Are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.65,1:03:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我闭嘴 老实滚出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shut up, and get fuck off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.03,1:03:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.55,1:03:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想干嘛? 自以为了不起啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want? You think you're hero?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.53,1:03:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.75,1:03:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.96,1:03:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人说过你很美吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has anyone ever told you you're beautiful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.27,1:03:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为她就是个美人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause she's a beautiful woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.40,1:03:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.32,1:03:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦 嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow... Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.90,1:03:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达奇 给我乖一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dutch! Back in the cage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.17,1:03:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dutch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.32,1:03:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手 达奇 住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold, Dutch, hold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.57,1:03:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,管好你的人 别让他乱来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Control your boy, please. Control your boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.34,1:03:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达奇 住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dutch, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.68,1:04:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则今晚回去跪搓板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or back to kneel washboard tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.41,1:04:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真抱歉 刚才是过去的我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry. That is the old me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.51,1:04:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 大家都冷静下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's everybody just calm down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.45,1:04:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们都把枪放下 放轻松{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's lower the heat, lower the guns. Let's relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.88,1:04:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,二战已经结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}World War II is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.92,1:04:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们即将看到前苏联最重要的机密之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are about to see one of the biggest Soviet secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.92,1:04:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美国第一个把人类送上了月球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}America first to send man to the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.33,1:04:23.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但苏联却是抢先把照相机送了上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But USSR first to send camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.83,1:04:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1959年 我们的月球3号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In 1959, our Luna 3.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.93,1:04:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拍摄了月球背面的照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}take picture of the dark, the shadow side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.27,1:04:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,空无一物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sees nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.81,1:04:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但到了1963年 月球4号发现了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in 1963, Luna 4 sees...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.37,1:04:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪的石堆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strange rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.00,1:04:41.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对 - 就在飞船周围{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Around the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.25,1:04:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有好几百块{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hundreds of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.98,1:04:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给他们看照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, show picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.42,1:04:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有些拖拽的痕迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With some drag marks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.32,1:04:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我见过这个 这些不是石头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen these. These aren't rocks,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.52,1:04:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是能量柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these are pillars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.69,1:04:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用来建造太空桥的能量柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alien pillars for a space bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.89,1:04:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道这些 是因为汽车人手里有五根{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know about them because the Autobots have five of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.33,1:05:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霸天虎一定搜查过整条船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Decepticons must have raided the ship before{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.99,1:05:04.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在阿波罗11号抵达之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apollo 11 ever got there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.79,1:05:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿走了能量柱 并藏了起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}took the pillars, and hid them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.54,1:05:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这不合逻辑 既然霸天虎找到了飞船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't make sense. The Decepticons have the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.42,1:05:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也拿走了全部能量柱 那为什么偏偏留下了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have all those pillars. Why would they leave Sentinel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.25,1:05:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一会使用它们的御天敌呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when he's the only one who can use them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.84,1:05:14.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.58,1:05:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就是霸天虎仍然觊觎的目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the one thing they still need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.05,1:05:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得赶紧去找御天敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to meet up with Sentinel,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.48,1:05:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,守在他身旁 保卫他的安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rendezvous with him and keep him safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.08,1:05:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梅琳 我刚刚找到御天敌 擎天柱10分钟后就到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mearing, I just picked up Sentinel. Optimus is 10 minutes behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.65,1:05:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们正在返回NEST{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're coming to NEST now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.36,1:05:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维特维奇先生 我提醒过你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Witwicky, I thought I made it clear to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.13,1:05:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要再打这个电话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I did not want you calling this phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.83,1:05:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 整件事都是个陷阱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, the whole thing has been a setup since the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.30,1:05:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霸天虎希望擎天柱找到御天敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Decepticons wanted Optimus to find Sentinel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.63,1:05:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为只有擎天柱才能复活他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because only Optimus could revive him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.58,1:05:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但太空桥在我们手中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we have the space bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.36,1:05:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梅琳 你手中只有5个能量柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mearing, you have five pillars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.04,1:05:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚得知霸天虎有几百个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just learned that they have hundreds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.74,1:05:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是在被他们牵着鼻子走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're doing exactly what they wanted you to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.21,1:05:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟你说的是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you need me to say to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.54,1:05:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霸天虎很快就会来找御天敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Decepticons are coming for Sentinel Prime!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.17,1:05:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们马上出发去NEST{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to NEST.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.91,1:05:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能量警报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have an Energon alert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.25,1:05:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在华盛顿州际公路上发现能量讯号...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Energon readings detected on the D. C. Parkway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.19,1:06:00.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正在追踪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Currently tracking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.49,1:06:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三辆黑色越野车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}three black Suburbans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.26,1:06:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大黄蜂 你掩护御天敌离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee, you got to get Sentinel out of here! You got to guard him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.67,1:06:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 天啊 我要被炒鱿鱼了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, mein Gott! I'm fired!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.56,1:06:55.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当心 当心 当心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out! Watch out! Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.03,1:07:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.61,1:07:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,射击 射击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot him! Shoot him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.74,1:07:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干掉他 大黄蜂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot him, Bee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.96,1:07:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大黄蜂 再开快点 再快 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee, you've got to move faster! Faster, Bee! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.95,1:07:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大黄蜂 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee, faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.95,1:08:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 回NEST{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, back to NEST!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.59,1:08:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恐龙 我来对付他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dino, I got him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.93,1:08:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,铁皮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ironhide!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.39,1:09:01.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么问题吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.33,1:09:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦 搞得跟西部片对决一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little Mexican standoff we got here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.46,1:09:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放下武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapons down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.97,1:09:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会让你们体面地离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we'll let you escape with your dignity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.17,1:09:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丢掉武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.61,1:09:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.85,1:09:23.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,铁皮 当心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ironhide, watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.35,1:09:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,铁皮 接枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ironhide, catch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.58,1:09:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当心背后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behind you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.25,1:09:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霸天虎小混混{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Decepticon punk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.28,1:09:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,管教完毕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Class dismissed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.86,1:10:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 都进去 快 - 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get inside! Let's go! - Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.18,1:10:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行动 动作快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.39,1:10:04.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 伦诺克斯 - 行动 行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lennox! - Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.86,1:10:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到处都是霸天虎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got Decepticons everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.19,1:10:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经派出全部人马去搜捕他们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got my whole team deployed looking for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.76,1:10:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,铁皮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ironhide!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.29,1:10:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保护御天敌 带他到里面去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protect Sentinel! Get him locked up inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.10,1:10:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,包在我身上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.41,1:10:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要保卫好他 他是整件事的关键{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you've got to guard him, 'cause he's the key to the whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.36,1:10:16.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说得没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.60,1:10:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汽车人兄弟们 你们必须意识到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you must realize, my Autobot brothers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.57,1:10:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们当年根本赢不了那场战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is we were never going to win the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.61,1:10:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了保住我们的母星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the sake of our planet's survival,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.81,1:10:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不得不和威震天...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a deal had to be made...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.98,1:10:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做了笔交易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with Megatron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.30,1:10:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,退后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.94,1:10:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.40,1:10:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我马上就让你解脱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hereby discharge you from duty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.76,1:10:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 大黄蜂 - 退后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bee! - Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.01,1:11:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,NEST全部人马撤回基地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rally all NEST forces back to the base!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.35,1:11:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快 - 不...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.38,1:11:10.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.62,1:11:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫个医疗兵来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a medic down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.80,1:11:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们人手不足{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have enough men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.36,1:11:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要和御天敌硬碰硬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not engage Sentinel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.10,1:11:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走后门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just go to the back gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.55,1:11:30.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,趴下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take cover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.31,1:11:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前进 前进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch left! Watch left!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.08,1:11:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go! Follow me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.85,1:11:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.21,1:11:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.81,1:11:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快 快 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}move move move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.25,1:11:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等等 - 退后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Director, don't go there! - Stand down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.36,1:11:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 御天敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Sentinel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.42,1:11:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 局长 - 出什么事了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Director - What is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.19,1:11:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think you are doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.90,1:11:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个首领{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a Prime!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.68,1:12:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会听命于你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not take orders from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.80,1:12:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梅琳主任 我们打不过他 撤退吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Director Mearing, come on. We can't fight him. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.14,1:12:06.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.82,1:12:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把我的东西还给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now return what belongs to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.63,1:12:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.43,1:12:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 大家都还好吗? - 都出去了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You guys okay? - Is everybody out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.37,1:12:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家保持镇静 马上就没事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, stay calm. You're gonna be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.95,1:12:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看看 擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, take a look, Optimus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.31,1:12:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这都是你的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is all on you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.04,1:12:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,御天敌破坏了仓库{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sentinel hit the vault!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.24,1:12:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把能量柱抢走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took the pillars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.85,1:12:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快 我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.25,1:12:51.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 通知101空降师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, notify the 101St Airborne!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.62,1:12:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得抓住那个家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to hunt this thing down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.14,1:13:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.53,1:13:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,篝火弄的 热乎乎的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hot from our little campfire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.83,1:13:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,夹心巧克力饼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}S'mores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.09,1:13:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 简直是在世外桃源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that great? We're really living off the land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.23,1:13:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈爸 见到卡莉回家了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, Dad, have you guys seen Carly come home yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.07,1:13:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说 你就不会敲门吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Can you knock, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.66,1:13:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的卧室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is our bedroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.01,1:13:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她难道会不回家吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why wouldn't she be at home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.01,1:13:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们吵架了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.27,1:13:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许分手了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we might have broken up,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.85,1:13:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也可能只是暂时分开 我不太清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or be on a break. I don't really know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.08,1:13:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么? 不 - 我不想谈这事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? No. - Look, I can't talk about it right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.37,1:13:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 妈 我不想谈细节 我必须找到她 - 你在开玩笑吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't go into details, Mom. I have to find her. - Kiding me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.98,1:13:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坐下 我们开个家庭会议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down. We're having a family meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.95,1:13:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正式的家庭会议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Family meeting!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.02,1:13:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may not know this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.99,1:13:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我和你爸也不是一直这么恩爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but your father and I were not always this perfectly happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.69,1:13:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结婚这些年来 我也曾想过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, there was a time in our marriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.24,1:13:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没法和这人生活下去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I thought this was not gonna work out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.94,1:13:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 请别说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}please, Can we please not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.51,1:13:38.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不明白你怎么能... - 她真伤我的心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm just you understand - She's damaging him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.18,1:13:40.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...和一个世界级美女分手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You break up with one world-class hottie...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.05,1:13:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别说了 停下好吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Stop. Stop, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.95,1:13:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她甩了我 我再去找个更好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She dumped me, I moved on to something better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.62,1:13:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不就行了吗? 我还更幸福呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. I'm a happier person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.53,1:13:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这已经是第二个美人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The second beautiful girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.13,1:13:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我一把{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you help me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.94,1:13:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又失去它她?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lose her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.34,1:13:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们只是发生争执 - 是打架了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They had an argument. - One fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.57,1:13:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 可是你找不到第三个了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, but you're not going to get a third one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.94,1:13:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说除非你那个很大...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean unless you have like a big...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.83,1:13:55.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么乱七八糟的... 老妈 别说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the F... Mom, mom, mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.10,1:13:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你大概都不知道自己在干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean you just don't know what you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.73,1:13:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不想再说了 - 你需要读读书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't want to talk about this anymore. - You need the book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.55,1:14:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,男人永远是错的 记着这句话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're always wrong. Get used to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.25,1:14:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这本 你拿去好好读一读{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. You've gotta read this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.04,1:14:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在《女人至上》这本书中 对付女人的招术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She Comes First. here's some killer shit in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.08,1:14:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.69,1:14:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 - 哦 又来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - That's it, I'm going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.39,1:14:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.91,1:14:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.64,1:14:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坐下 坐下 替我说几句{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down, sit down! Back me up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.54,1:14:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老婆开心 生活舒心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy wife, happy life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.51,1:14:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没错 - 老婆不满{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Unhappy wife,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.28,1:14:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就余生悲惨咯...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stone-cold misery for the rest of your...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.72,1:14:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 闭嘴 - 这是实话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop. - It's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.00,1:14:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想说的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I'm saying is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.02,1:14:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你爱这女孩吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do you love this girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.59,1:14:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这辈子就认她了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's the one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.32,1:14:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就去把她追回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you gotta go get her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.79,1:14:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你 你爸和我吵架的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, your dad and I, when we had troubles,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.62,1:14:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会不惜一切去找我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he moved heaven and earth to find me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.78,1:14:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他你当时怎么说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would he, say what you said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.20,1:14:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快说 - “我会陪你到地老天荒”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Say it. - "I will follow you to the end of time".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.77,1:14:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来很傻吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that suck or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.66,1:14:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就像狗屎爱情剧一样 - 不 很浪漫啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's like a bad sci-fi film. - No. It is so sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.45,1:14:38.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们得离开这个城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to get out of the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.25,1:14:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走得越远越好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get as far away from here as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.59,1:14:40.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.22,1:14:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.41,1:15:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.30,1:15:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多么完美的计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a brilliant scheme!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.37,1:15:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来御天敌离开塞伯坦时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So when Sentinel left Cybertron,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.01,1:15:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就已经是叛徒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was to defect?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.74,1:15:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他本该和我在地球会合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was meant to rendezvous with me here on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.49,1:15:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁知命运使我们擦肩而过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before fate waylaid us both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.12,1:15:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,复活他的唯一途径{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only way to revive him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.67,1:15:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是擎天柱和他的领导模块{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we needed Prime and his Matrix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.11,1:15:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高 实在是高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent strategy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.94,1:15:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的 我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine, mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.32,1:15:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他现在是您的伙伴了 主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he is now your partner, master?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.06,1:15:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我最伟大的战利品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is my greatest triumph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.43,1:15:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我对您五体投地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.23,1:15:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始传输{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commencing transport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.50,1:15:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手 不要 御天敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! No! No, Sentinel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.47,1:15:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原谅我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.97,1:15:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.87,1:15:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和我们战斗吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight us now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.84,1:16:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保持联系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Contact!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.92,1:16:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心 走 走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out! Move it! Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.08,1:16:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汽车人 撤退{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autobots, retreat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.68,1:17:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 御天敌 为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, Sentinel, why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.67,1:17:17.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了塞伯坦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Cybertron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.05,1:17:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了我们的家园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For our home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.73,1:17:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,战争的破坏我们可以修复{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What war destroyed, we can rebuild!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.12,1:17:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但必须和霸天虎合作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But only if we join with the Decepticons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.19,1:17:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 还有别的方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not the only way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.32,1:17:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里才是我们的家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is our home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.79,1:17:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须保护人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must defend the humans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.39,1:17:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你误入歧途了 擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So lost you are, Optimus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.46,1:17:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在塞伯坦 我们被敬若神明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On Cybertron, we were gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.70,1:17:38.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里 地球人却叫我们“机器”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here, they call us machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.27,1:17:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人类要么成为我们的奴仆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let the humans serve us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.27,1:17:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要么就灭亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or perish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.31,1:17:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没杀你算你走运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lucky I didn't kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.78,1:17:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将来你会明白的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In time you'll see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.65,1:17:51.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这还不算完{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.08,1:17:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我是他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if I were him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.32,1:17:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一秒钟都不会让你离开我的视线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't let you out of my sight for one second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.66,1:18:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有意思 来这的路上我一直琢磨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's funny. I was just thinking on the way over here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.60,1:18:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的需要迪伦给点建议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could really use some advice from Dylan, and there he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.16,1:18:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 而他就在这里 能跟你谈谈吗? - 欢迎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I speak to you, Carly? - Welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.77,1:18:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请坐 喝杯酒吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, sit down. Have a drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.80,1:18:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说 我不想喝酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what, I don't need a drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.53,1:18:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不在乎车子 工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or a car, or a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.93,1:18:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就想和我女友单独谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need to speakto my girlfriend alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.40,1:18:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会介意吧 电灯泡先生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that okay with you, Mr. Inappropriate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.07,1:18:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.98,1:18:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 出什么事了? - 到外面再说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's going on? - I'll tell you outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.95,1:18:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为我能帮你 山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really think I can help you, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.55,1:18:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾和父亲探讨如何做出抉择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember a talk I had with my dad once about tough choices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.32,1:18:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜现在不是时候 咱们回头再聊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, now's not the time. We'll set something up, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.29,1:18:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然那是很久以前了 那时我父亲的公司还在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, it was way back, when my dad's firm was in charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.45,1:18:34.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为国家航空航天局做经费预算和财务报表{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of budget review and accounting for NASA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.56,1:18:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他教给我的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, the thing that he taught me was,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.93,1:18:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这战争与你无关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when it's not your war,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.29,1:18:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就最好站在能赢的那方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you join the side that's going to win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.39,1:18:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.20,1:18:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太直接了 我的老毛病?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too direct? Or is it just me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.78,1:18:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点也不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly not you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.30,1:19:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.73,1:19:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.80,1:19:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来人啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.52,1:19:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 山姆 我不能出来 - 谁来救救她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sam, I can't get out! - Someone get help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.56,1:19:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 晚安 - 晚安 迪伦先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good night! - Good night, Mr. Dylan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.27,1:19:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 救我出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.85,1:19:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.25,1:19:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救救她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.28,1:19:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还年轻 早晚会明白的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's young. He will learn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.15,1:19:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 救我出去 - 晚安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get me out! - Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.59,1:19:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚很愉快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a fun night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.22,1:19:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为自己是第一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really think you're the first man ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.33,1:19:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,涉足外星人事务的人吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}asked to join the noble alien cause?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.56,1:19:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.76,1:19:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道为什么1972年之后 我们再也没有登月吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know why we've not been back to the moon since 1972?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.06,1:19:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这两位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because these two,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.93,1:19:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们来找我父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they came to my dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.77,1:19:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要求他伪造一些账目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they told him to do some creative accounting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.00,1:19:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拼命拔高登月预算{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it way too expensive to ever go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.90,1:19:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 他和其他人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, he and the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.69,1:19:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,终止了美俄两国的太空计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shut down the American and Russian space programs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.20,1:19:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自此这二位便成为了我们的客户{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they've been our clients ever since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.71,1:19:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你帮他们杀人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You helped them kill people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.87,1:19:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我有得选择吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think they'd give you a choice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.24,1:19:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说 我个人也没有参与{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, it's not like I personally participated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.81,1:19:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是个联络人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a liaison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.28,1:19:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只负责传话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I liaise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.62,1:19:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该是坏人出场的时候了 山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hostile takeover time, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.29,1:20:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.14,1:20:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.66,1:20:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放她走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.99,1:20:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.20,1:20:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我监视你很多年了 山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had my eye on you for years, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.17,1:20:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你是个间谍 我一直无法在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the one spy I've never been able to provide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.10,1:20:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在汽车人身边安插间谍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as someone close to the Autobots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.91,1:20:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 别照他说的做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam! Don't do what he wants!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.45,1:20:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, he will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.04,1:20:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们都会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They all do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.88,1:20:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会杀了她 你懂吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will slaughter her, you understand me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.72,1:20:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要一眨眼的功夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the time it takes you to blink,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.37,1:20:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就会杀了她 然后杀了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they'll do it to her and they'll do it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.37,1:20:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 你至少该尊重下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you show a little respet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.02,1:20:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个给你推荐工作的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when someone offers you a job!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.12,1:20:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,手腕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.83,1:20:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要去找擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are to track down Optimus Prime,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.63,1:20:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为在人类中他最信任你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you're the one human he trusts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.43,1:20:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要问他一个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you will ask one question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.93,1:20:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他打算如何反击?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does he intend to fight back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.47,1:20:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么策略 什么战术 全都给我套出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strategies, tactics, everything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.52,1:20:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咬得够狠吧 对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has a nasty little bite, doesn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.44,1:20:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可是高科技{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very high-tech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.64,1:21:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它能让我们看你所看 听你所听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It lets us see what you see, hear what you hear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.75,1:21:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还能介入你的神经系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it taps your nervous system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.25,1:21:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你不要妄想警告其他人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, if you so much as try and signal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.09,1:21:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要告诉你 山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what to tell you, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.62,1:21:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有果就有因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relationships have consequences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.49,1:21:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我站在这儿是因为我父亲 她待在这儿是因为你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am here because of my father. She is here because of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.89,1:21:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手 住手 住手 住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop, stop! Stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.86,1:21:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,震荡波 收敛点行吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soundwave, would you please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.10,1:21:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.77,1:21:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你乖乖办事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do your job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.64,1:21:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会没事的 我向你保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll be safe. I give you my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.71,1:21:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会杀了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.24,1:21:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也向你保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.45,1:21:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,指挥中心已发布一级战备状态{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Combatant Commands are now at DEFCON 1.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.65,1:21:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世界各地潜伏着大约两百个霸天虎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Approximately 200 Decepticons are now in hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.72,1:21:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甚能量都检测到存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Energon detectors have been triggered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.35,1:21:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至远在南美和中国的能量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as far away as South America and China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.96,1:21:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,联合国刚刚收到一份加密音频文件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The U. N. Just received an encrypted audio file.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.66,1:21:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是来自汽车人的超级领袖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say it's from the leader of the Autobots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.53,1:21:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地球的保卫者们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Defenders of Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.25,1:21:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来到这里寻求自然资源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have come for your natural resources.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.93,1:22:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以重建我们满目疮痍的母星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to rebuild our damaged planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.04,1:22:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的所有要求得到满足后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we have transported all we need,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.24,1:22:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就会和平地离开地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we will leave your world in peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.41,1:22:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了保证这份和平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For such peace to exist,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.38,1:22:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们必须立即驱逐已收留的汽车人叛逆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you must immediately exile the Autobot rebels you have harbored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.92,1:22:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有谈判的余地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nonnegotiable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.08,1:22:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,立即驱逐那些叛逆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Renounce the rebels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.15,1:22:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们等候你们的答覆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We await your reply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.22,1:22:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会跟进你的情报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll debrief you in transit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.96,1:22:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道能帮什么忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I really don't see how I can be of any help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.46,1:22:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再说你们也挺忙的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you guys seem pretty busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.59,1:22:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以下次再谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could just do this another time, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.03,1:22:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来我过去真是低估了你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have underestimated you at every turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.80,1:22:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.54,1:22:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你提醒过我们 他们在利用人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You warned us that they were using humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.27,1:22:38.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也说过御天敌是全局的关键{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you knew that Sentinel was the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.27,1:22:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Director!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.81,1:22:41.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我算啥啊? 你们才是专家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who am I? Hey, you're the expert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.78,1:22:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是一个四处走动的危险家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just a walking security risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.69,1:22:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.52,1:22:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.85,1:22:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.82,1:22:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不对 你出了很多汗 - 真的 我没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, you're not. You're sweating. - I'm fine. I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.59,1:22:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的没事 我出汗是因为紧张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sweating because I'm nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.32,1:22:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我紧张是因为你把这些讯息告诉给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm nervous because you got me in here with this information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.46,1:23:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我特别喜欢用推特 什么秘密都会写到博客上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'm a Twitter junkie. I blog everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.43,1:23:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦 你不敢的 - 真的 我不骗你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't keep a secret to save my life. - You wouldn't dare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.80,1:23:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 要是你敢的话... - 主任 15号线有你的电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's the truth. I'm telling you. - Director, the Pentagon's calling in 15.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.10,1:23:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.20,1:23:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么 你在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing. What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.50,1:23:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离我远点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.84,1:23:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天 在国会发生的事件具有重大意义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a remarkable series of events today at the Capitol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.54,1:23:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在不久之前 国会通过法案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just moments ago, legislation was passed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.61,1:23:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,决定将汽车人驱逐出美国领土{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to exile the Autobots from American shores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.51,1:23:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而他们与美国的军事同盟也正式宣告结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The U.S. Military alliance with them is officially over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.22,1:23:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 议会和政府的... - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- In the words of the House Majority Leader... - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.79,1:23:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主要负责人就本次决议回答了提问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the sponsor of today's resolution,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.55,1:23:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好的 - 我们的良心不允许我们...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. - "We cannot in good conscience..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.80,1:23:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.89,1:23:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不能这么做 你得告诉他们 他们不能这样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can't do this. You gotta tell them. They can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.06,1:23:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 政府已经下令 行动吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. It's official. It's a go, people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.94,1:23:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汽车人是我们的盟友 我们曾并肩作战 生死与共{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are our allies. The Autobots fought for us. They fought with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.10,1:23:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果怎么样呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And where are we now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.20,1:23:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兵临城下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Facing an enemy invasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.80,1:23:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且敌方兵力无法估量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with an enemy that has the means to deploy countless more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.18,1:23:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你还知道些什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there is any more you know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.68,1:23:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,任何关于敌人意图的讯息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}anything at all about the enemy's intentions,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.41,1:23:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在该告诉我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now is the time to tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.92,1:23:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汽车人没办法离开地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autobots have no way of leaving this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.72,1:23:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that is where you're wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.94,1:23:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,飞船名叫苍耳号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its name is the Xanthium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.59,1:24:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是它运来了第二批汽车人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It brought the second wave of Autobots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.23,1:24:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,此后一直由国家航空航天局保管和研究{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's been under NASA 's care and study ever since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.46,1:24:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将它和一艘退役航天飞机捆绑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We linked it with a decommissioned shuttle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.16,1:24:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,使其在汽车人离开之前都处于军方控制之下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to maintain military control until they're gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.00,1:24:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个脆弱的螺栓将承受到一万磅的扭力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna be 10, 000 pounds of torque on that itsy-bitsy bolt,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.44,1:24:13.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不关我事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, not my thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.60,1:24:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是在拿我同伴的生命冒险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna risk the livesof all me mates!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.61,1:24:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鄙视你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll ball you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.71,1:24:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是雷霆拯救队 他们负责维护苍耳号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These guys are the Wreckers. They take care of the Xanthium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.24,1:24:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一般不让他们离开基地 因为他们都不是好鸟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't let them off the base much, 'cause they're assholes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.28,1:24:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要用力拉 废物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta pull that, ya nancy swanker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.55,1:24:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么用力会弄坏的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's torqued to kill them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.14,1:24:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在帮你 你懂的 尽点力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just trying to help, you know. Just doing my job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.42,1:24:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.41,1:24:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是人类不是机器人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave him alone. This is a human being.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.78,1:24:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 艾普斯 - 你简直不可理喻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Epps! - You are ridiculous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.88,1:24:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.52,1:24:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What up, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.32,1:24:33.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么在这里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.12,1:24:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从空军退役了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I retired from the Air Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.06,1:24:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放开我的手行吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you let my hand go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.96,1:24:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.30,1:24:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,退役后我来到这儿做顾问和协调工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I just consult to run interference for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.58,1:24:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别乱帮忙行吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're not helping!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.60,1:24:46.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用打仗了 也不用被外星人追杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more combat and aliens shooting at my ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.10,1:24:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总算找到了梦寐以求的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a dream job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.20,1:24:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是时候离开这星球了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to get off this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.31,1:24:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们要把汽车人赶走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kicking the Autobots out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.34,1:24:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能相信这样的事吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you believe this is happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.34,1:24:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他们要飞往哪里吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you think it's taking them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.84,1:24:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之是地球之外的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any planet but here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.72,1:25:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想和这里的头儿谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna talk to whoever's in charge here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.62,1:25:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为是谁呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.15,1:25:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是夏洛特·梅琳啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlotte Mearing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.76,1:25:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,西蒙斯探员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent Simmons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.79,1:25:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前探员西蒙斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Former Agent Simmons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.83,1:25:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你没死在华盛顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I see you survived Washington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.56,1:25:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,华盛顿 埃及 失恋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Washington, Egypt, heartbreak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.62,1:25:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都挺过来了 我还会活下去的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I survive. I will survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.43,1:25:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们正在动员所有的情报人员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're bringing everybody in, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.03,1:25:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,情报人员正在汇集所有的情报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Putting all the intel on the table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.44,1:25:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你以为驱逐9个汽车人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you think deporting nine Autobots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.30,1:25:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就能解决问题的话...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is gonna solve a damn thing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.52,1:25:27.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事我做不了主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's out of my hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.54,1:25:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你高升了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moving up in the world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.54,1:25:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的臀部真美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your booty looks excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.68,1:25:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要是敢跟别人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever say word to anyone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.34,1:25:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说起在匡提科那晚的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...about what happened that night in Quantico.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.42,1:25:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就把你的心掏出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll cut your heart out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.39,1:25:44.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你早就掏走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You already did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.56,1:25:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sammy, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.36,1:25:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别让他们驱逐我们 - 别抛弃我们 山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't let them exile us. - Don't let them take us, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.20,1:25:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是霸天虎的圈套{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a Decepticon trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.24,1:26:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,检查氮气量 我们准备发射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check the nitrogen levels. We're booking out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.94,1:26:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.11,1:26:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的领导人说得对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What your leaders say is true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.48,1:26:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这都是我的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was all my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.14,1:26:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉他们谁值得信赖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told them whom to trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.58,1:26:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实在是大错特错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was so wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.55,1:26:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不怪你 只是这举动更像人类而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't make it your fault. It just makes you human for a change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.52,1:26:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.49,1:26:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以对我们失去信心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may lose your faith in us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.39,1:26:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但绝不要对自己失去信心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but never in yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.57,1:27:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道你打算如何反击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to know how you're gonna fight back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.97,1:27:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你一定有策略 我知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this is strategy, I know you're...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.32,1:27:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们会带援军回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're coming back with reinforcements, something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.84,1:27:10.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们有计划...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know there's a plan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.94,1:27:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以跟我说 其他人不会知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can tell me. No other human will ever know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.11,1:27:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.28,1:27:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要是照他们说的做 到时该如何面对自己呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we just do what they want, how are we gonna live with ourselves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.36,1:27:28.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的朋友 山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are my friend, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.66,1:27:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永远都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You always will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.83,1:27:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你们的领导人已经做出了决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But your leaders have spoken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.86,1:27:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从现在起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From here,{\r}
