Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.62,1:28:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 动作快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, hustle up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.58,1:28:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天亮就发射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're launching at dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.73,1:28:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会尽自己所能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna do whatever we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.58,1:28:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让地球得到保护{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it like it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.46,1:28:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你永远是我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will always be my friend,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.97,1:28:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.50,1:28:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta be going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.88,1:28:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多年以后 若子孙们问起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Years from now, they're gonna ask us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.05,1:28:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当年地球被占领的时候 你们在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Where were you when they took over the planet?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.63,1:28:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只能说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna say,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.63,1:28:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是站在那里袖手旁观{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We just stood by and watched".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.97,1:28:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(早上6点30分)
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.38,1:28:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的应当把这看成是一种合作关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should really look at this as a partnership.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.72,1:29:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就应该顺应潮流{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to stand on the side of progress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.31,1:29:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想被载入史册{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you wanna be a part of history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.81,1:29:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,6...5...4...3...2\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}six, five, four, three, two,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.74,1:29:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1...0\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one, zero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.95,1:29:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发射成功全速推进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead and throttle up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.70,1:29:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要答案 你已经拿到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted an answer. You got one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.34,1:29:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要的都能到手 山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always get what I want, Sam.{\r}
