Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.34,1:29:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们乖乖上路了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That they would go without a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.32,1:30:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 再说一遍 - 探测到不明目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Say again. - Tracking an incoming object.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.74,1:31:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在都是在为霸天虎卖命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all work for the Decepticons now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.84,1:31:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(伊利诺伊州 芝加哥市)
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.13,1:31:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你帮忙追踪一个电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your help to track a phone call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.39,1:31:14.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电话那头的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a man on this phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.27,1:31:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是霸天虎的人类代表{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the head of their human operations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.20,1:31:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们抓走了我的女友卡莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he has Carly hostage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.63,1:31:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我坐好了 别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to sit down. Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.63,1:31:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他马上就开过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm watching him drive up right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.09,1:31:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电话是在路上打出的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The call was placed en route.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.81,1:31:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在要侵入手机摄像头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm hacking into the phone's camera now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.73,1:31:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看 这是摄像头的实时画面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, that's it. That's a live stream from the camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.90,1:31:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方我来确定手机通讯基站位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someplace... Hold on. I can triangulate this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.44,1:31:39.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确认 是芝加哥的基站{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, it's Chicago cell sites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.87,1:31:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那里 找到了 特朗普大厦 在芝加哥 矮的那栋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, I've got it. Trump Tower, Chicago. Lower penthouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.51,1:31:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.18,1:31:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要去那里 - 你确定吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm going. - You sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.98,1:31:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你帮了我 我15个小时之内要赶到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's done nothing but try to help me, and I can be there in 15 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.75,1:31:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能让你一个人去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not going alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.69,1:31:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,NEST的总部那里还有我的老战友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still got my NEST friends out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.84,1:32:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会召集起他们 找到你的女友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll round them up, we'll find your girlfriend,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.97,1:32:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后逮住那家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're gonna bring this guy in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.53,1:32:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要帮我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you helping me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.86,1:32:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为那个混账也害死了我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause that asshole killed my friends, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.44,1:32:25.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们说想要地球的资源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said they were here for our resources,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.47,1:32:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重建他们的星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to rebuild their planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.93,1:32:29.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 但事实上只需要一种资源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but really one resource in particular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.33,1:32:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们星球上独一无二的资源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One unique to our planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.83,1:32:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人类?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.84,1:32:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你很聪明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're very smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.97,1:32:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有劳动力他们无法重建家园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, they can't rebuild without a slave labor force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.67,1:32:44.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有哪个星球能提供60亿工人呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many rocks up there in the universe offer six billion workers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.04,1:32:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.01,1:32:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么多人 能运走吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't transport people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.35,1:32:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用不着把人带走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not shipping people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.39,1:32:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会把星球运到这里来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're shipping their planet here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.56,1:32:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.02,1:33:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,御天敌在这里干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's Sentinel doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.69,1:33:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.79,1:33:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们将数百能量柱放置在全球各地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're spreading hundreds of pillars around the globe right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.53,1:33:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几个小时后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In just a few hours,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.60,1:33:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等它们被发射到轨道上启动后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're gonna launch them into orbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.33,1:33:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就会将塞伯坦传送到我们的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and bring Cybertron into our atmosphere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.73,1:33:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,红色的那根是主控柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The red one there controls the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.90,1:33:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦激活 传输就将全面启动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He triggers that, it starts the whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.07,1:33:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滚开 小肉虫 你的任务已经结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be gone, insect operative. Your work is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.14,1:33:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 遵命 阁下 - 他真是个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your Excellency. - He's such a dick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.12,1:33:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你希望悲剧发生吗? - 我只希望能活着 多活40年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want this to happen? - I want to survive. I want 40 more years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.19,1:33:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我想这样啊?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I asked for this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.59,1:33:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这都是客户要求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I inherited a client.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.02,1:33:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 等塞伯坦来了 人类全成了奴隶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and when Cybertron's here and we're all their slaves,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.67,1:33:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,估计到时也需要个工头吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess they'll still need a human leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.54,1:33:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少咒我 想活命就听我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't jinx me. You want to survive, you listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.71,1:34:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该让地球上的奴隶们认识他们的新主子了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is time for the slaves of Earth to recognize their masters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.85,1:34:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,封锁全城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seal off the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.14,1:35:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把狗都牵出来 带到后面去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the dogs outta here now! Get them in the back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.71,1:35:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他们没告诉你还有这计划吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess they didn't tell you about this part, did they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.88,1:35:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不是每场会议都参加的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I'm at every meeting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.31,1:35:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里很安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.78,1:35:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们答应过我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said I was safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.93,1:35:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's roll!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.47,1:35:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才还有讯号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had a signal earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.67,1:35:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在一点也没了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.61,1:35:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在播送全国紧急广播{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a national emergency broadcast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.82,1:35:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芝加哥遭受了猛烈的攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chicago has suffered a massive attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.46,1:36:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跑错路了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.53,1:36:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快掉头 回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here! Go back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.14,1:36:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一批外星人飞船包围了芝加哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a ring of alien ships around Chicago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.85,1:36:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的远程轰炸机刚刚被击落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our high-range bombers were just knocked out of the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.75,1:36:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们无法突破城市上空 敌人的空中防线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can 't get through enemy air defenses over the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.82,1:36:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的卫星也受到干扰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our satellites have been jammed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.10,1:36:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无法监控敌人的行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have no way to monitor the enemy's movement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.39,1:36:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,NEST的所有部队 在空军基地待命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our old NEST teams are on stand-down holding at Grissom Air Force Base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.93,1:36:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,距战区有10分钟路程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're about 10 minutes from the battle zone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.28,1:36:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特种部队正在试图进入市区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have Special Forces trying to gain access to the city,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.13,1:36:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,步兵正在外围布控{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and infantry is staging at the perimeter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.04,1:36:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 怎么搞成这样了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, excuse me, it just doesn't make sense!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.64,1:36:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就看不到一点画面吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't we get any eyes in there at all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.11,1:36:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的侦察机都被击落了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They keep shooting down our drones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.24,1:36:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们把我们变成了瞎子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want us blind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.88,1:36:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们还有迷你无人侦察机 可以试试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we do have a couple of mini-drones we're gonna try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.95,1:36:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁在管无人侦察机?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, whoever's manning these UAV drones,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.18,1:36:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问他飞机能否改飞特朗普大厦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can we try to redirect them toward Trump Tower?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.18,1:36:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子 维特维奇正在赶往芝加哥的路上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The kid, Witwickety, was on his way to Chicago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.92,1:37:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说霸天虎的人类间谍 就在那栋大厦里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Said some point-man human op is there for the Decepticons!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.66,1:37:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 如果说我知道什么 我只知道这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, if I know anything, I know this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.96,1:37:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霸天虎祸害到哪里 那小子就跟到哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that kid is an alien-bad-news magnet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.58,1:37:51.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.50,1:37:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要在这样的混乱之城中找到她?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We came here to find her in the middle of all that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.36,1:37:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们真的要进去吗? 艾普斯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we really going out there, Epps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.98,1:37:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.31,1:38:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人想进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.45,1:38:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.12,1:38:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不去 我也要去找她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With or without you, I'll find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.52,1:38:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是在找死 山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna get yourself killed, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.66,1:38:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是想这么做吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.99,1:38:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是想这么做吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.73,1:38:20.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你大老远跑来这里送死?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came all the way out here to get yourself killed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.07,1:38:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗? 好好听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh? Listen to what I'm saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.83,1:38:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是因为我才被抓来这的 你知道吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's here because of me. Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.44,1:38:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 如果你执意要进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, if you go in this building,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.74,1:38:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即使她还活着待在里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's if she's even still alive,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.49,1:38:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也根本找不到她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's no way you're gonna be able to reach her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.86,1:38:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你说我该怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you suggest I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.81,1:38:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.15,1:38:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉这么说 但真的全完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, but it's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.65,1:38:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.08,1:38:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}uhp...Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.02,1:39:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要杀他们个片甲不留{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will kill them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.85,1:39:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雷霆拯救队 废掉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wreckers, kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.17,1:39:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这会很疼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is going to hurt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.98,1:39:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很疼吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.38,1:39:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的领导人不明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your leaders will now understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.15,1:39:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霸天虎绝不会放过你们的星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Decepticons will never leave your planet alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.22,1:39:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因此 我们需要让他们相信我们死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we needed them to believe we had gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.73,1:40:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今日 我们以自由的名义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For today, in the name of freedom,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.20,1:40:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正式向霸天虎宣战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we take the battle to them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.11,1:40:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我亲眼目睹你们的飞船爆炸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw your ship blow up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.73,1:40:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,飞船? 我们根本就不在那飞船上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ship? We were never in the ship!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.42,1:40:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只造船 不坐船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We designed the damn thing, didn't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.19,1:40:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都藏在第一节火箭助推器里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were hidden in the first booster rocket to separate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.43,1:40:41.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后就按计划降落在大西洋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Splashed down back in the Atlantic, just as planned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.15,1:40:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们哪里也不去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ain't going nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.00,1:40:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 没人能赶走我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, no one's exiling us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.87,1:40:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汽车人要留下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Autobots are staying right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.11,1:40:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮你们赢得战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna help you win this war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.08,1:40:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们封锁了城市 形成防御要塞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're surrounding the city to make a fortress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.95,1:40:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以没人能看到他们在城内的举动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that no one can see what they're up to inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.35,1:41:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们唯一的机会就是奇袭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our only chance is the element of surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.19,1:41:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我知道怎么能看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I know where to look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.84,1:41:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迷你无人侦察机 接近特朗普大厦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mini-drone is on approach to Trump Tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.13,1:41:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说山姆上那里去了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're telling me Sam's headed into that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.07,1:41:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.57,1:41:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他可能永远到不了目的地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably never got close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.24,1:41:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会开这玩意 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you can fly this thing, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.12,1:41:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 那是什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that What is that What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.66,1:41:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马马虎虎?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So-so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.38,1:41:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是马马虎虎那就太杯具了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you so-so can fly this. That feels terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.10,1:41:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们给你殿后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're right behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.09,1:41:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们突进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, we're going in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.65,1:42:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,城市已经戒严{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The city is secure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.28,1:42:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人类已经不可能阻止我们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The humans cannot stop us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.49,1:42:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到下午的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As the afternoon falls,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.76,1:42:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,余下的能量柱将到达预定发射地点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the rest of the pillars will reach their launch position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.36,1:42:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是多年以前 我向你承诺的胜利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the victory I promised you so many years ago,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.20,1:42:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将在此携手重建塞伯坦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where we rebuild Cybertron together!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.60,1:42:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和你共事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have deigned to work with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.35,1:42:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是为了确保我们的星球能幸存下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that our planet may survive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.85,1:42:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我绝不会为你卖命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will never work for you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.58,1:42:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好记住这两者之间的差别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would be wise to remember the difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.10,1:43:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 烦死了 我最讨厌等待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm so sick of this. I'm just sick of waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.78,1:43:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.38,1:43:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.21,1:43:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你挺有种的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got some balls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.53,1:43:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.70,1:43:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.18,1:43:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no! no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.64,1:43:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.91,1:43:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.98,1:43:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快跳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump!{\r}
