Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.78,1:45:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,试试看它能否运作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stone, check and see if it's still working.{\r}
