Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.40,1:45:46.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,飞行控制中心 能接收到吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flight Control, do you copy?{\r}
