Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.30,1:45:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做点什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.07,1:45:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 快启动 启动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, work! Work!{\r}
