Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.24,1:46:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做点什么 能把镜头转过来吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do something Can you rotate or something?{\r}
