Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.21,1:46:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 好了 他们能看见我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay, okay. They can see us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.82,1:46:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芝加哥现在是中心战场 知道吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chicago is ground zero, do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.55,1:46:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 能听见吗? - 维特维奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you hear us? - Witwicky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.95,1:46:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.35,1:46:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听好了 御天敌就在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please listen. Sentinel Prime is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.73,1:46:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有他那些太空桥的零件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he has the pillars to his space bridge.{\r}
