Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.06,1:46:15.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在霍奇基斯·古尔德投资大厦楼顶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's owned by Hotchkiss Gould Investments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.39,1:46:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主控柱是装置的核心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, the pillar that controls everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.99,1:46:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在东南角的穹顶里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is in the southeast cupola.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.33,1:46:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要搞定主控柱 立刻摧毁它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to destroy the pillar. You have to shoot down the pillar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.67,1:46:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不然他们就要把塞伯坦传送过来了明白吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or they're going to transport Cybertron here, do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.34,1:46:24.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 明白了吗? - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you understand? - What?{\r}
