Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.41,1:46:33.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 从这里到东南方 - 好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The southeast cupola. - All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.75,1:46:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得抢在被敌机发现之前采取行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to move before the fighters spot us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.38,1:46:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里等着 我们先去探路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait here until we scout a route ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.82,1:46:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's roll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.89,1:46:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,铁皮 掩护高处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ratchet, cover high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.15,1:46:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你觉得能用火箭弹打下主控柱吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, think we could use that rock et to shoot down the pillar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.68,1:46:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们离那里有8个街区远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're eight blocks away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.12,1:46:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要打中的话 得再接近点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to get closer to take a shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.59,1:46:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用靠近 到高处去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not closer. Higher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.42,1:46:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得确保视野清晰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a clear line of sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.78,1:46:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那需要过河{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's across the river. Gonna have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.11,1:46:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很难悄悄潜进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a hell of a time trying to sneak up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.34,1:46:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只有一炮的机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We only got one shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.73,1:46:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一炮就足够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One shot's all we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.27,1:47:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要看到那幢大厦周围的情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to be able to see around that building from the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.87,1:47:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,联络国家安全局 调来该地区的监视器分布图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get NSA to send service specs for any cameras in that area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.98,1:47:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许还有能用的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe some are working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.28,1:47:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,交通灯 提款机 只要带摄像头的都行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Traffic lights. ATMs. Anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.51,1:47:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.81,1:47:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想反击吗? 那就只能穿滑翔衣飞进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to hit back? We're gonna have to wingsuit in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.35,1:47:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们接近那里的唯一方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only way to get close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.81,1:47:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能保证跟我去的都能活着回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't promise anyone a ride home, but if you're with me,{\r}
