Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.23,1:47:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我自己能回来 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll find my own ride home, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.50,1:47:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.69,1:47:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有我 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.24,1:47:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莫绍尔将军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Morshower,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.11,1:47:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请求派兵在城南牵制敌军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}requesting diversionary action to the south of the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.67,1:47:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们从北面降落突入 迫使他们向东转移{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're coming north and low. You guys drive them to the east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.02,1:47:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汽车人必胜 汽车人必胜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Autobot victory! Autobot victory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.70,1:48:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得提醒你们 外面的霸天虎真是太恐怖了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta warn you. It's scary out there, Decepticons!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.72,1:48:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们夺走了我的车厢 我需要其中的飞行装备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got my trailer. I need that flight tech.{\r}
