Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.34,1:48:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雷霆拯救队 你们去引开他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wreckers, we need a diversion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.89,1:48:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们去露一手 - 你说的没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's get some! - You got that right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.84,1:48:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听好了 我们要设法进入那栋玻璃幕墙大楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, we're gonna circle around to that glass building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.93,1:48:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到制高点发射火箭炮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we'll get high enough to make the rocket shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.05,1:48:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们牵制他的火力 我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while you guys draw his fire. Let's move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.21,1:48:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.15,1:49:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不带着我的巷战新武器 我可不会放你们出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not letting you go out there without my urban combat prototypes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.44,1:49:03.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了 Q 别闹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to go, Que! Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.27,1:49:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等嘛 这些可是给高手用的绝妙玩意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, they're great inventions for kicking ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.67,1:49:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些是什么玩意?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.49,1:49:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些是爆破棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are boom-sticks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.06,1:49:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,定时30秒爆炸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Armed in 30 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.26,1:49:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有抓钩手套 可以爬墙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grapple gloves, for climbing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.32,1:49:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出去 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go! Move your ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.20,1:49:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去 去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.54,1:49:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快快 - 我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move, move! - Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.05,1:49:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 啊 - 喔 喔 喔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ah. - Oh, oh, oh.{\r}
