Dialogue: 0,2:16:21.39,2:16:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你教会我“自由权利归众生”{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were the one who taught me freedom is everyone's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:28.60,2:16:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会重启能量柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will retrigger that pillar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:30.80,2:16:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你得先过我这关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you'll have to go through me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:37.69,2:16:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我得去帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I've got to try and help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:39.63,2:16:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别 别去 - 我自己去 你留在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't you go. Don't go. - I have to. You stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.68,2:16:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be fine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.81,2:16:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我保证 - 你得答应我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay? - I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:44.34,2:16:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得到主控能量柱那去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to get to that pillar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:47.26,2:16:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿下能量柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charge the pillar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:49.24,2:16:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汽车人来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got Autobots!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:07.94,2:17:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要支援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reinforcements!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:09.88,2:17:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霸天虎 向擎天柱开火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Decepticon ships, fire at Optimus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.41,2:17:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发射 我现在就需要那些战斧导弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're taking fire! I need those Tomahawks now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.26,2:17:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第一波导弹即将到达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First wave inbound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:28.19,2:17:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须掩护擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to cover for Optimus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:44.61,2:17:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霸天虎 夺回能量柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Decepticons, trigger the pillar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:48.59,2:17:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重启能量柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Restart that pillar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:51.25,2:17:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,启动那根能量柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trigger the pillars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:53.31,2:17:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我挡不住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't hold them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:55.15,2:17:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要闪一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ships have us pinned!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:58.75,2:17:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:59.95,2:18:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离导弹到达还有10秒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inbound, 10 seconds! Danger close!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:02.59,2:18:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,解码 重复 重复14250{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark-Lima-Echo-Echo, 14250!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:05.31,2:18:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 指示收到 - 请给座标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Positive surface contact. - Target I. D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:07.47,2:18:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已获取目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target acquired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:36.48,2:18:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:37.75,2:18:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等等 - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:41.13,2:18:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dylan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:44.06,2:18:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手 住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:45.93,2:18:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:47.80,2:18:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能这样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't do this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:49.10,2:18:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:50.39,2:18:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说只有一个未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one future for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:16.16,2:19:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,塞伯坦 你终于得救了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cybertron, you are saved,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:20.59,2:19:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在最后时刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...at last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:30.60,2:19:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 你是来向我投降的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, have you come to surrender?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:35.17,2:19:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这一切都值得吗? - 当然了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Was it all worth it? - Obviously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:37.82,2:19:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你费尽心机救回了御天敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All your work to bring Sentinel back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:39.71,2:19:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而现在他却夺走了你所有的权力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now clearly he has all the power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:41.91,2:19:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都有点替你感到难过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's actually almost tragic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:43.85,2:19:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你胆敢教训我 奴隶?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dare lecture me, slave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:47.02,2:19:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算你的霸天虎最终征服这个星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Decepticons finally conquering this planet,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:49.88,2:19:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的超级领袖也不会是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and yet, their leader won't be you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:51.42,2:19:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定是我 永远是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be me! It will always be me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:56.46,2:19:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再过个几分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In any minute now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:59.11,2:20:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就什么都不是了 只是个御天敌的奴才{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll be nothing but Sentinel's bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:10.07,2:20:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再发射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:13.20,2:20:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:26.73,2:20:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在选阵营时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You chose sides?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:29.04,2:20:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,选错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You chose wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:36.47,2:20:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直是我们中最勇敢的战士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always the bravest of us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:42.01,2:20:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你总是无法做出艰难抉择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you could never make the hard decisions!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:45.17,2:20:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:47.71,2:20:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的星球会生存下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our planet will survive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:52.06,2:20:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:02.86,2:21:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们曾经是神 我们全都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were gods once. All of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:06.13,2:21:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但在这里...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:07.37,2:21:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:08.50,2:21:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,神只能有一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...there will only be one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:22.03,2:21:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my planet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:36.44,2:21:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚拯救了另一个世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just saved a whole other world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:38.43,2:21:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你是英雄?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you're a hero, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:40.36,2:21:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你是个英雄吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you're a hero?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:41.52,2:21:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:42.86,2:21:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只不过是个送信的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just a messenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:51.50,2:21:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太空桥仍然连接着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pillar's still connected!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:55.32,2:21:56.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点 等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch, wait up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:56.98,2:21:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 大黄蜂 - 快走 快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bee! - Let's go, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:58.18,2:21:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们一起做吧 - 快点 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's do this! - Move, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:59.11,2:22:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它仍在运作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pillar's still connected!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:00.85,2:22:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摧毁那根能量柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rip that pillar down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:26.21,2:22:26.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:28.05,2:22:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该停战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we need a truce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:30.16,2:22:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只不过想重掌领导权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I want is to be back in charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:34.10,2:22:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,此外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:35.74,2:22:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有我你能做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who would you be without me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:38.35,2:22:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,擎天柱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prime?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:39.65,2:22:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们走着瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:04.44,2:23:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,擎天柱 我所想要的 不过是我们种族的延续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Optimus, all I ever wanted was the survival of our race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:10.68,2:23:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须明白 我不得不背叛你的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must see why I had to betray you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:15.25,2:23:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你并没有背叛我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't betray me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:17.75,2:23:20.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你背叛了你自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You betrayed yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:20.89,2:23:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 擎天柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Optimus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:18.21,2:24:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,山姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:59.22,2:25:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我爱你 - 我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I love you. - I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:03.49,2:25:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这世上我只需要你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the only thing I need in this world,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:04.86,2:25:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会为你做任何事 我保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'll do anything to make it up to you, I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:08.34,2:25:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可要信守承诺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to hold you to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:11.07,2:25:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要再放我走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just never let me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:13.23,2:25:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:20.24,2:25:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,戒指?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:29.49,2:25:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱这辆车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love this car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:31.42,2:25:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大黄蜂 你得悠着点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee, you've got to slow it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:33.15,2:25:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,悠着点来 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to slow way down, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:35.87,2:25:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想帮个忙 老兄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just trying to help out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:39.16,2:25:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,战争之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In any war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:41.11,2:25:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总会有暴风雨之间的平静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there are calms between storms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:44.93,2:25:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你小子很勇敢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fought bravely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:46.40,2:25:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候我们会失去信念{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There will be days when we lose faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:48.69,2:25:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候我们的盟友会背叛我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Days when our allies turn against us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:52.40,2:25:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们绝对不会放弃地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the day will never come that we forsake this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:57.02,2:25:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和地球上的人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and its people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:20.65,2:26:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥的美好未来就从这一刻开始了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I call the start of a beautiful future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:26.25,2:26:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,逮捕他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arrest him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:28.50,2:26:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那也值{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was worth it!{\r}
